1390>>>>>>>>>    Move (Length(sString) ) to iPos
1391>>>>>>>>>    While (iPos >0)
1395>>>>>>>>>        If (Mid(sString, 1, iPos)) In sDelimeters ;            Function_Return iPos
1398>>>>>>>>>        Decrement iPos
