1623>>>>>>>    
1623>>>>>>>    // Use this function to add a Bitmap, Icon, or Cursor to the imagelist. All images will be scaled to 16x16 pixels.
1623>>>>>>>    // The type is determined by the file extension in the passed image name: .bmp = bitmap, .ico = icon, .cur = cursor.
1623>>>>>>>    // For bitmaps the top left pixel is used to identify the transparent color. Semi-transparent pixels in alpha-blend
1623>>>>>>>    // icons are rendered as black pixels.
1623>>>>>>>    //
1623>>>>>>>    // See also AddBitmap, AddCursor, AddIcon.
1623>>>>>>>    //
1623>>>>>>>    // sImage  - is the image filename being loaded.
1623>>>>>>>    // Returns - the image index of the loaded image or -1 if an error occurs.
1623>>>>>>>    Function AddImage String sImage Returns Integer
1625>>>>>>>        Integer iImage
1625>>>>>>>        String sExt
1625>>>>>>>        
1625>>>>>>>        Move -1 to iImage // assume inability to add
1626>>>>>>>        
1626>>>>>>>        // Determine the file type....
1626>>>>>>>        Move (Uppercase(ExtractFileExt(sImage))) to sExt
1627>>>>>>>        
1627>>>>>>>        Case Begin
1627>>>>>>>            Case (sExt = ".ICO")   // icon
1629>>>>>>>                Get AddIcon sImage to iImage
1630>>>>>>>                Case Break
1631>>>>>>>            
1631>>>>>>>            Case (sExt = ".CUR")   // cursor
1634>>>>>>>                Get AddCursor sImage to iImage
1635>>>>>>>                Case Break
1636>>>>>>>            
1636>>>>>>>            Case Else              // for all others assume bitmap
1636>>>>>>>                Get AddBitmap sImage IL_AutoTransparency to iImage
1637>>>>>>>                Case Break
1638>>>>>>>        Case End
1638>>>>>>>        
1638>>>>>>>        Function_Return iImage
1639>>>>>>>    End_Function
1640>>>>>>>    
1640>>>>>>>    // pass image width and height based on 100% (96dpi) and convert it to
1640>>>>>>>    // the current DPI. 16=small, 32=large
1640>>>>>>>    Procedure ScaleSizes Integer ByRef iSizeX Integer ByRef iSizeY
1642>>>>>>>        Number isize
1642>>>>>>>        Number nScale
1642>>>>>>>        Move (GetSystemMetrics(SM_CXSMICON)) to iSize
1643>>>>>>>        Move (iSize/16.0) to nScale
1644>>>>>>>        Move (nScale * iSizeX) to iSizeX
1645>>>>>>>        Move (GetSystemMetrics(SM_CYSMICON)) to iSize
1646>>>>>>>        Move (iSize/16.0) to nScale
1647>>>>>>>        Move (nScale * iSizeY) to iSizeY
1648>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
1649>>>>>>>    
1649>>>>>>>End_Class
