1971>>>>>>>Class Help_Mixin is a Mixin
1972>>>>>>>    
1972>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_Help_Mixin
1974>>>>>>>        Property Integer Help_Id         0
1975>>>>>>>        Property String  Help_Keyword    ''
1976>>>>>>>        // added in 11.1 - this will be the recommended method for finding a page (instead of help_id and mapping)
1976>>>>>>>        Property String  psHtmlHelpTopic ""
