2048>>>>>>>    // Protected Message:
2048>>>>>>>    //    Send passed message to the help object passing the self
2048>>>>>>>    //
2048>>>>>>>    Procedure Exec_Help Integer iHelpMessage
2050>>>>>>>        If (Help_object_Id <= 0) ;            Error DFERR_HELP_SYSTEM C_$ThereIsNoHelpSystem
2053>>>>>>>        Else ;            Send iHelpMessage of Help_object_Id Self
2055>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
