2571>>>>>>>//      Provides a fix for foreign kbds where the top number row is altered
2571>>>>>>>//      (i.e. French numbers are shifted). This replaces logic found in the
2571>>>>>>>//      C msg_key handler for dfForm and dfEntry. This will be removed when the
2571>>>>>>>//      code is fixed in C.
2571>>>>>>>
2571>>>>>>>// All of these methods
2571>>>>>>>// are fixes that will get moved to the runtime at some point and all their
2571>>>>>>>// detail is quite private.
