3348>>>>>    
3348>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
3350>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
3352>>>>>        Send Define_RGB_Support_Temp_Mixin
3353>>>>>        
3353>>>>>        Property Integer Auto_Size_State True
3354>>>>>        
3354>>>>>        Property Integer Label_Shadow_Display_Mode TBShadow_On_Group
3355>>>>>        
