3368>>>>>    Procedure Use_Parent_Color
3370>>>>>        Integer Txtclr Backclr
3370>>>>>        Delegate Get TextColor to TxtClr
3372>>>>>        Delegate Get Color to backClr
3374>>>>>        If (Backclr = Txtclr) ;            Move CLBlack to Txtclr
3377>>>>>        Set TextColor to TxtClr
3378>>>>>        Set Color to backClr
3379>>>>>    End_Procedure
3380>>>>>    
3380>>>>>    Procedure Set Value Integer Item# String Val
3382>>>>>        If (Auto_Size_State(Self)) ;            Send Autosize Val
3385>>>>>        Forward Set Value Item# to Val
