3453>>>>>    Procedure Page_Object Integer iState
3455>>>>>        Integer obj
3455>>>>>        Get owner_object to obj
3456>>>>>        If (iState and Obj) ;            Send Request_Locate_Label to Obj // optimized version
3459>>>>>        Forward Send page_Object iState
