3465>>>>>        If Obj Begin
3467>>>>>            Get Label_Shadow_Display_Mode of Obj to iMode
3468>>>>>            If ( ( (iMode=TBSHADOW_ON_GROUP or iMode=TBSHADOW_ON_ALL) and ;                Implicit_Shadow_State(Obj) ) or ;                ( (iMode=TBSHADOW_ON_LOCAL or iMode=TBSHADOW_ON_ALL) and ;                Explicit_shadow_state(Obj) ) ) ;                Move 0 to iEnable
3471>>>>>            Else ;                Move 1 to iEnable
3473>>>>>            Send Enable_Window iEnable
3474>>>>>        End
3474>>>>>>
3474>>>>>    End_Procedure
