3798>>>>>    // Marks label info as dirty. If the object is active it
3798>>>>>    // actually makes the change. As of 15.0, this is public
3798>>>>>    // and can be used to force a resize if you change the
3798>>>>>    // font metrics of an active label.
3798>>>>>    Procedure ReSize_Label
3800>>>>>        Set Label_Needs_Sizing_State to True // dirty label mark
3801>>>>>        // if object is active, we will immediately update the changes
3801>>>>>        If (Window_Handle(Self)) ;            Send Locate_label
3804>>>>>    End_Procedure
3805>>>>>    
3805>>>>>    // Optimized locate label. Only does it if needed
