4011>>>>>    Procedure Redirect_Message Returns Integer
4013>>>>>        Integer Msg# Aux# Rval
4013>>>>>        Get Message to Msg#
4014>>>>>        Get Aux_Value to Aux#
4015>>>>>        //
4015>>>>>        If Msg# Begin // Since Menupopup Is 0, This Will Get Skipped
4017>>>>>            If (Aux# = 0) Begin       // If No Destination
4019>>>>>                Get Focus of desktop to Aux#     // Try To Send To Focus
4020>>>>>                If (Aux# <= Desktop) ;  // As Long As Focus Is Not The Desktop.                    Move 0 to Aux#
4023>>>>>            End
4023>>>>>>
4023>>>>>            If Aux# ;                Get Msg# of Aux# to Rval
4026>>>>>            Procedure_Return Rval
4027>>>>>        End
4027>>>>>>
4027>>>>>    End_Procedure
