4132>>>>>    Function GuiSize Returns Integer
4134>>>>>        Handle hWnd
4134>>>>>        Integer cy cx iVoid
4134>>>>>        tWinRect Rect
4134>>>>>        tWinRect Rect
4134>>>>>        Get Window_Handle to hWnd
4135>>>>>        If hWnd Begin
4137>>>>>            Move (GetWindowRect(hWnd, AddressOf(Rect))) to iVoid
4138>>>>>            Move (rect.right-Rect.left) to cx
4139>>>>>            Move (Rect.bottom-Rect.top) to cy
4140>>>>>        End
4140>>>>>>
4140>>>>>        Else Begin
4141>>>>>            Move 28 to cy
4142>>>>>            Move 28 to cx
4143>>>>>        End
4143>>>>>>
4143>>>>>        Function_Return ( cy*65536 + cx )
4144>>>>>    End_Function
