4190>>>>>Class Standard_Object_Mixin is a Mixin
4191>>>>>    
4191>>>>>    Procedure Define_Standard_Object_Mixin
4193>>>>>        Send Define_RGB_Support_Temp_Mixin
4194>>>>>        
