4292>>>>>    End_Function
4293>>>>>    
4293>>>>>    Procedure Set Default_Action_Button Integer hoButton
4295>>>>>        Handle hFoc
4295>>>>>        Set private.default_action_button to hoButton
4296>>>>>        // anytime the default button changes the highlighted button
4296>>>>>        // may or may not change. So we reset the action button just in case. This
4296>>>>>        // means that ALL objects must understand this message (which is mixed into
4296>>>>>        // standard object mixin).
4296>>>>>        Get focus of desktop to hFoc
4297>>>>>        If (hFoc > desktop) ;            Send DoResetCurrentButton to hFoc
4300>>>>>    End_Procedure
