4308>>>>>        If hoButton Begin
4310>>>>>            Get msg_KeyAction of hoButton to iRetVal
4311>>>>>            Procedure_Return iRetVal
4312>>>>>        End
4312>>>>>>
4312>>>>>        Else If gbKEnterNext ;            Send Next to (focus(desktop))
4316>>>>>    End_Procedure
4317>>>>>    
