4645>>>>>    Procedure Shadow_Display
4647>>>>>        Integer Clr Brdr State
4647>>>>>        Get Shadow_State to State
4648>>>>>        // as of 8.3 this has been altered so that the control remembers what its prior
4648>>>>>        // enabled color was.
4648>>>>>        If State Begin
4650>>>>>            If (piPriorEnabledColor(Self)=0) ;                Set piPriorEnabledColor to (Color(Self))
4653>>>>>            Delegate Get Color to Clr
4655>>>>>        End
4655>>>>>>
4655>>>>>        Else Begin
4656>>>>>            Get piPriorEnabledColor to Clr // this could be zero, if it is, do nothing..it was never disabled
4657>>>>>            Set piPriorEnabledColor to 0
4658>>>>>        End
4658>>>>>>
4658>>>>>        If (Clr<>0) ;            Set Color to Clr
4661>>>>>        Send Label_Shadow_Display
