4997>>>>>        If (iType=Date_Window or iType=Mask_Date_Window) Begin
4999>>>>>            Get Base_Date to dDate
5000>>>>>            Move (dDate +iValue) to dDate
5001>>>>>            Set Value iCur to dDate
