5008>>>>>        Get form_datatype iCur to iType
5009>>>>>        Get Value iCur to iRval
5010>>>>>        // date support. We will make all dates relative from today
5010>>>>>        If (iType=Date_Window or iType=Mask_Date_Window) Begin
5012>>>>>            Get Base_Date to dDate
5013>>>>>            If (iRval<>0) ;                Move (iRval-dDate) to iRval
5016>>>>>        End
