5602>>>>>    // With form based objects we can set capslock by setting
5602>>>>>    // the right bit in forms_options. We use the
5602>>>>>    // options message instead of the option message because
5602>>>>>    // form_option doesn't seem to work right.
5602>>>>>    //
5602>>>>>    Procedure Set Capslock_State Integer bState
5604>>>>>        Integer iOptions
5604>>>>>        Get Form_Options 0 to iOptions
5605>>>>>        If bState ;            Move (AddBitValue(Capslock_Bit_Value, iOptions)) to iOptions
5608>>>>>        Else ;            Move (RemoveBitValue(Capslock_bit_Value, iOptions)) to iOptions
5610>>>>>        Set form_Options 0 to iOptions
5611>>>>>    End_Procedure
5612>>>>>    
5612>>>>>    // check capslock bit for capslock_state
5612>>>>>    //
5612>>>>>    Function CapsLock_State Returns Boolean
5614>>>>>        Integer iOptions
5614>>>>>        Get form_Options 0 to iOptions
5615>>>>>        Function_Return ( (iOptions iand CAPSLOCK_BIT_VALUE)<>0 )
5616>>>>>    End_Function
