5747>>>>>
5747>>>>>Class EntryList is a DFBaseEntryList
5748>>>>>    
5748>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
5750>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
5752>>>>>        Send Define_Standard_Grid_Mixin
5753>>>>>    End_Procedure
5754>>>>>    
5754>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol Standard_Grid_Mixin
5755>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol Datafile_Help_Mixin
5756>>>>>    
5756>>>>>    //  This replace Set Current_Item in standard grid mixin. It is
5756>>>>>    //  identical except that it checks for noenter fields and it
5756>>>>>    //  handles scroll requests from the thumb.
5756>>>>>    //
5756>>>>>    // 1. Modified to optimize painting and make scrolling work properly
5756>>>>>    // 2. Add Request_Status_Help for item changes.
5756>>>>>    //
5756>>>>>    Procedure Set Current_Item Integer Itm
5758>>>>>        Integer IsFoc
5758>>>>>        Integer oldst oldtop
5758>>>>>        Integer opt CrntCol NumCols
5758>>>>>        Get Line_Size to NumCols
5759>>>>>        // Currently the C entrylist class returns a big number if the
5759>>>>>        // thumb is moved to top. It passes -1 (65535)* # cols + cur col.
5759>>>>>        // This will be value of 65535*#cols or greater!
5759>>>>>        // If the end of bar is thumbed it will return displayable-rows+1
5759>>>>>        // * number of cols. This will always be greater than item count.
5759>>>>>        If (Itm>=65535*NumCols or Itm<0) ;            Send beginning_of_Data
5762>>>>>        Else If (Itm>=item_count(Self)) ;            Send End_of_Data
5766>>>>>        Else Begin
5767>>>>>            // if the target is NoEnter (or expression or displayonly) then
5767>>>>>            // we will move to the selected row but stay in the current column.
5767>>>>>            Get item_option Itm NoEnter to opt
5768>>>>>            If Opt Begin
5770>>>>>                Get current_Col to CrntCol
5771>>>>>                Move (itm/NumCols*NumCols+CrntCol) to itm
5772>>>>>                Get item_option itm NoEnter to opt // if still Noenter
5773>>>>>                If Opt ;                    Procedure_Return                 // do nothing
5776>>>>>            End
5776>>>>>>
5776>>>>>            //
5776>>>>>            Move (Focus(Desktop)=Self) to IsFoc
5777>>>>>            If IsFoc ;                Send Request_Status_Help False
5780>>>>>            Get dynamic_update_state to oldst
5781>>>>>            Set Dynamic_Update_State to False
5782>>>>>            Get top_item             to oldtop // we need to know if to-item changes
5783>>>>>            Forward Set Current_Item to Itm
5785>>>>>            // If dyn had been on, we pass 1 (refresh all) if we scrolled and a
5785>>>>>            // 2 (refresh dirty cells) if we did not scroll. Note that other
5785>>>>>            // processes might have dirtied the cells so that a "2" becomes
5785>>>>>            // equivalent to a "1"
5785>>>>>            If oldst ; // if top_Item changed we scrolled!                Move (If(Top_Item(Self)<>OldTop,1,2)) to OldSt
5788>>>>>            Set dynamic_update_State to OldSt
5789>>>>>            If IsFoc ;                Send Request_Status_Help True
5792>>>>>        End
5792>>>>>>
5792>>>>>    End_Procedure
5793>>>>>    
5793>>>>>    
5793>>>>>    Procedure End_Construct_Object
5795>>>>>        Send Define_Form_Margins
5796>>>>>        Send Define_List_Form_Columns
5797>>>>>        Forward Send End_Construct_Object
5799>>>>>    End_Procedure
5800>>>>>    
5800>>>>>End_Class
