5848>>>>>    Procedure Notify_Application_Activation Integer bActivate
5850>>>>>        Handle hMain
5850>>>>>        Get Main_Window of desktop to hMain
5851>>>>>        // if main window exists send event to main window, else just send
5851>>>>>        // the event to itself. Normally a main window will (should) exist
5851>>>>>        If (hMain = 0) ;            Move Self to hMain
5854>>>>>        Forward Send Notify_Application_Activation bActivate
5856>>>>>        If bActivate ;            Send OnActivateApp   to hMain
5859>>>>>        Else ;            Send OnDeactivateApp to hMain
5861>>>>>    End_Procedure
