6408>>>>>//  1. Define standard MDI properties
6408>>>>>//       caption bar, sysmenu, minimize, no-maximize
6408>>>>>//       attach-prnt-st=T, Scope=T, Ring=T, Popup=T
6408>>>>>//  2. Define Ctrl+F4 - Close_client (deactivate view)
6408>>>>>//            Ctrl+F6 - previous view
6408>>>>>//            Alt+F6  - next view
6408>>>>>//  3. Define procedures for:
6408>>>>>//            Switch_next_View, Switch_Prior_View, Close_Client
6408>>>>>//  4. redefine exit_appication to close_client so sysmenu works.
6408>>>>>//
