6445>>>>>        Get GuiSize to iSize
6446>>>>>        Move ( ((hi(iClntSize) -  hi(iSize))/2)  max 2) to iRow
6447>>>>>        Move ( ((low(iClntSize) - low(iSize))/2) max 2) to iCol
6448>>>>>        Set GuiLocation to iRow iCol
6449>>>>>        Send Adjust_Logicals
