6710>>>>>>>    // The tab that is the current "active" tab. If the tab page is
6710>>>>>>>    // defined and it is not active the current_tab returns -1. If -1
6710>>>>>>>    // you can use item_count to find the tab that is rolled forward
6710>>>>>>>    //
6710>>>>>>>    Function Current_Tab Returns Integer
6712>>>>>>>        Integer id itm
6712>>>>>>>        If (item_count(Self)) Begin
6714>>>>>>>            Get current_item to itm
6715>>>>>>>            Get tab_page_id itm to id
6716>>>>>>>            // if no tab page or tab page is not active there
6716>>>>>>>            // can no current tab
6716>>>>>>>            If (Id=0 or Active_State(id)=0) ;                Move -1 to itm
6719>>>>>>>            Function_Return itm
6720>>>>>>>        End
6720>>>>>>>>
6720>>>>>>>        Function_Return -1
6721>>>>>>>    End_Function
