7317>>>>>>>        Forward Set Label to sLabel
7319>>>>>>>        
7319>>>>>>>        Get Window_Handle of (parent(Self)) to hWnd
7320>>>>>>>        If hWnd Begin
7322>>>>>>>            Move (sLabel+Character(0)) to wsLabel
7323>>>>>>>            
7323>>>>>>>            Get Tab_Button_Item to iPage
7324>>>>>>>            
7324>>>>>>>            Move TCIF_TEXT to TcItem.Mask
7325>>>>>>>            Move (AddressOf(wsLabel)) to TcItem.pszText
7326>>>>>>>            Move (SendMessage(hWnd, TCM_SETITEM, iPage, AddressOf(tcItem))) to iVoid
7327>>>>>>>            Move (InvalidateRect(hWnd, 0, 1)) to iVoid // force the window to be re-painted
7328>>>>>>>            
7328>>>>>>>        End
