7735>>>>>>>        If dataobj ;            Function_Return (item_count(dataobj))
7738>>>>>>>    End_Function
7739>>>>>>>    
7739>>>>>>>    // get/set Combo_current_item serve no purpose as this deals with the
7739>>>>>>>    // DF list of values (and not the windows position). There just isn't anything
7739>>>>>>>    // you can do with this.
7739>>>>>>>    Function Combo_Current_Item Returns Integer
7741>>>>>>>        Integer dataobj
7741>>>>>>>        Get Combo_data_object to dataobj
7742>>>>>>>        If dataobj ;            Function_Return (current_item(dataobj))
7745>>>>>>>    End_Function
7746>>>>>>>    
