8206>>>>>    // With entry based objects we can set capslock by setting
8206>>>>>    // the right bit in item_options AND form_Options. We use the
8206>>>>>    // options message instead of the option message because form_
8206>>>>>    // option doesn't seem to work right.
8206>>>>>    //
8206>>>>>    Procedure Set Capslock_State Integer bState
8208>>>>>        Integer iOptions
8208>>>>>        Get Item_Options 0 to iOptions
8209>>>>>        If bState ;            Move (AddBitValue(CAPSLOCK_BIT_VALUE, iOptions)) to iOptions
8212>>>>>        Else ;            Move (RemoveBitValue(CAPSLOCK_BIT_VALUE, iOptions)) to iOptions
8214>>>>>        Set Item_Options 0 to iOptions
8215>>>>>        Set form_Options 0 to iOptions
8216>>>>>    End_Procedure
8217>>>>>    
8217>>>>>    // check capslock bit for capslock_state
8217>>>>>    //
8217>>>>>    Function CapsLock_State Returns Integer
8219>>>>>        Integer iOptions
8219>>>>>        Get Item_Options 0 to iOptions
8220>>>>>        Function_Return ( (iOptions iand CAPSLOCK_BIT_VALUE)<>0 )
8221>>>>>    End_Function
