8265>>>>>>>    
8265>>>>>>>    // This event is triggered from the runtime. It now uses UChar arrays as the data might 
8265>>>>>>>    // not be a valid string (it can be any binary data). It still calls the original event for 
8265>>>>>>>    // backwards compatibility.
8265>>>>>>>    Procedure OnDataReceivedUC String sContentType UChar[] ucData
8267>>>>>>>        Send OnDataReceived sContentType (UCharArrayToString(ucData))
8268>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
8269>>>>>>>    
