8972>>>>>Class cWorkspace is a cObject
8973>>>>>    
8973>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
8975>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
8977>>>>>        
8977>>>>>        
8977>>>>>        Property String psAppSrcPath
8978>>>>>        Property String psBitmapPath
8979>>>>>        Property String psDataPath
8980>>>>>        Property String psDdSrcPath
8981>>>>>        Property String psDescription
8982>>>>>        Property String psFileList
8983>>>>>        Property String psHelpPath
8984>>>>>        Property String psHome
8985>>>>>        Property String psIdeSrcPath
8986>>>>>        Property String psProgramPath
8987>>>>>        Property String psAppHtmlPath
8988>>>>>        Property String psWorkspaceName
8989>>>>>        Property String psWorkspaceWSFile
8990>>>>>        Property String psConnectionIni
8991>>>>>        
8991>>>>>        Property String psSystemDfPath // took from the Registry!
8992>>>>>        Property String psSystemMakePath // took from the Registry!
8993>>>>>        Property String psDfPath        // Calculated
