9271>>>>>    Function OpenWorkspaceErrorMessage Integer eErrorCode Returns String
9273>>>>>        // Decodes the enumerated integer returned by OpenWorkspace and
9273>>>>>        // returns a corresponding message string.
9273>>>>>        String sError
9273>>>>>        
9273>>>>>        Case Begin
9273>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsWorkspaceOpened)
9275>>>>>                Move C_$NoErrors to sError
9276>>>>>                Case Break
9277>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsWorkspaceNotFound)
9280>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsName to sError
9281>>>>>                Case Break
9282>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsWorkspaceFileNotFound)
9285>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsFileFound to sError
9286>>>>>                Case Break
9287>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsDataPathEmpty)
9290>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsDataPath to sError
9291>>>>>                Case Break
9292>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsFileListEmpty)
9295>>>>>                Move C_$NoWsFileList to sError
9296>>>>>                Case Break
9297>>>>>            Case (eErrorCode = wsFileListNotExist)
9300>>>>>                Move C_$NoFileListCfg to sError
9301>>>>>                Case Break
9302>>>>>            Case Else
9302>>>>>                Move C_$UnknownError to sError
9303>>>>>                Case Break
9304>>>>>        Case End
9304>>>>>        
9304>>>>>        Function_Return (sError-".")
9305>>>>>    End_Function
