9332>>>>>        
9332>>>>>        Move (Length(sPaths) -1) to icChar
9333>>>>>        For iChar from 1 to icChar
9339>>>>>>
9339>>>>>            If (Mid(sPaths, 1, iChar) =";") ;                Increment icPath
9342>>>>>        Loop
9343>>>>>>
