10465>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_NUMERIC_RANGE                   to aUserErrors[7]
10466>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_DUPLICATE_REC                   to aUserErrors[8]
10467>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_TEXT_FIELD_TOO_LONG             to aUserErrors[9]
10468>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_FIND_PRIOR_BEG_OF_FILE          to aUserErrors[10]
10469>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_FIND_PAST_END_OF_FILE           to aUserErrors[11]
10470>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_NO_REC_TO_DELETE                to aUserErrors[12]
10471>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_FIELD_NOT_INDEXED               to aUserErrors[13]
10472>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_REC_NUMBER_RANGE                to aUserErrors[14]
10473>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_ENTER_VALID_REC_ID              to aUserErrors[15]
10474>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_OPERATOR_ERROR                  to aUserErrors[16]
10475>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_CANT_CHANGE_KEY_FIELD           to aUserErrors[17]
10476>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_NO_DELETE_RELATED_RECORDS_EXIST to aUserErrors[18]
10477>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_OPERATION_NOT_ALLOWED           to aUserErrors[19]
10478>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_OPERATOR                        to aUserErrors[20]
