10480>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_CLIENT_SOAP_TRANSFER            to aUserErrors[22]
10481>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_CLIENT_SOAP_FAULT               to aUserErrors[23]
10482>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_TEXT_TOO_LARGE_FOR_FIELD        to aUserErrors[24]
10483>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_WINPRINT                        to aUserErrors[25]
10484>>>>>>>>>        Move DFERR_CRYSTAL_REPORT                  to aUserErrors[26]
