10498>>>>>>>>>    Procedure HandleError Integer iErrNum Integer iErrLine String sErrText
10500>>>>>>>>>        //  Stub method implemented by subclass
10500>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
10501>>>>>>>>>    
10501>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the runtime when an error occurs. Initiates the main error handling. Skips errors
10501>>>>>>>>>    // that are ignored and makes sure to prevent recursion by checking the error processing state.
10501>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Error_Report Integer iErrNum Integer iErrLine String sErrText
10503>>>>>>>>>        If (pbErrorProcessingState(Self)) ;            Procedure_Return
10506>>>>>>>>>            
10506>>>>>>>>>        If (not(IsTrapped(Self, iErrNum))) ;            Procedure_Return
10509>>>>>>>>>        
10509>>>>>>>>>        Set pbErrorProcessingState to True
10510>>>>>>>>>        Set piCurrentErrorNumber to iErrNum
10511>>>>>>>>>        Set piCurrentErrorLine to iErrLine
10512>>>>>>>>>        
10512>>>>>>>>>        Send HandleError iErrNum iErrLine sErrText
10513>>>>>>>>>        
10513>>>>>>>>>        Set piCurrentErrorNumber to 0
10514>>>>>>>>>        Set piCurrentErrorLine to 0
10515>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to ghoErrorSource
10516>>>>>>>>>        Set pbErrorProcessingState to False
10517>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
