10577>>>>>>>>>    // Used to fetch the default error description.
10577>>>>>>>>>    //
10577>>>>>>>>>    // iError   - Error number
10577>>>>>>>>>    // sMessage - Additional error message
10577>>>>>>>>>    // Returns  - Complete error message
10577>>>>>>>>>    Function ErrorDescription Integer iError String sMessage Returns String
10579>>>>>>>>>        String sDescription
10579>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAvailable
10579>>>>>>>>>        
10579>>>>>>>>>        //  Fetch system error text
10579>>>>>>>>>        Get Error_Text of Desktop iError to sDescription
10580>>>>>>>>>        Get Error_Text_Available of Desktop iError to bAvailable
10581>>>>>>>>>        
10581>>>>>>>>>        //  Trim both messages
10581>>>>>>>>>        Move (Trim(sDescription)) to sDescription
10582>>>>>>>>>        Move (Trim(sMessage)) to sMessage
10583>>>>>>>>>        
10583>>>>>>>>>        //  Append message if needed
10583>>>>>>>>>        If (sMessage <> "") Begin
10585>>>>>>>>>            If (sDescription <> "" and bAvailable) Begin
10587>>>>>>>>>                Move (sDescription + Character(13) + Character(13) + sMessage) to sDescription
10588>>>>>>>>>            End
10588>>>>>>>>>>
10588>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
10589>>>>>>>>>                Move sMessage to sDescription
10590>>>>>>>>>            End
10590>>>>>>>>>>
10590>>>>>>>>>        End
10590>>>>>>>>>>
10590>>>>>>>>>        
10590>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sDescription
10591>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
10592>>>>>>>>>    
