10939>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Value(Self,iItem*3))
10940>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
10941>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10941>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_Value Integer iItem String sValue
10943>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value  (iItem*3) to sValue
10944>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
10945>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10945>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_Description Integer iItem Returns String
10947>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Value(Self,iItem*3+1))
10948>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
10949>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10949>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_Description Integer iItem String sValue
10951>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value  (iItem*3+1) to sValue
10952>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
10953>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10953>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_RowId Integer iItem Returns RowID
10955>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sRowId
10955>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Value (iItem*3+2) to sRowId
10956>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (DeSerializeRowId(sRowId))
10957>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
10958>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10958>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_RowId Integer iItem RowID riValue
10960>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Value  (iItem*3+2) to (SerializeRowId(riValue))
10961>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
10962>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10962>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Add_Table_Value String sData String sDescr RowID riRec
10964>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String  sVal
10964>>>>>>>>>>>>>        RowID   riRecVal
10964>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCnt
10964>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Item_Count to iCnt
10965>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_Value iCnt to sData
10966>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
10966>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // If one param passed use it for both display and database values
10966>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments <= 1);            Move sData  to sVal
10969>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move sDescr to sVal
10971>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_Description iCnt to sVal
10972>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
10972>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments <= 2) ;            Move (NullRowId()) to riRecVal
10975>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move riRec        to riRecVal
10977>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_RowId iCnt to riRecVal
10978>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
10979>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
10980>>>>>>>>>>>>>
10980>>>>>>>>>>>>>
10980>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class FileValidationTable is an DescriptionValidationTable
10981>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10981>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
10983>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
10985>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer No_Fill_State     False // this is never used and is obsolete. (JJT)
10986>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Ordering          1   // Indx1 is a good guess.
10987>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Type_Value        ''  // default these two to
10988>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Type_Field        0   // Undefined (none).
10989>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Code_Field        1   // Fld 1=code, 2=descr
10990>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Description_Field 2   // are good guesses.
10991>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
10991>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Code_Load_Object  0   // or (Code_Loader(Self))
10992>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
10993>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
10993>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Table_Loaded_State Returns Integer
10995>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRVal
10995>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get No_fill_State to iRVal // if true, table always is loaded
10996>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If not iRval ;            Forward Get table_loaded_State to iRVal
11000>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iRval
11001>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
11002>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11002>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Value String sCode Returns Integer
11004>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRVal
11004>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDSO
11004>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to iDSO
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // we use standard validate, if code is blank, OR if
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //   1. if no code DSO or the code DSO exists but is not busy.
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //   2. AND it is not no-fill
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //   3. AND it is static
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Else we find the record directly
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Note that the operation mode is busy during request_validate (the
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // ddo does this). WHen operation mode is busy we must not use
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // the code dso (must find manually).
11005>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sCode='' or ;            ( (iDSO=0 or Operation_Mode=0)    and ; // if no code DSO or DSO not busy            No_Fill_State(Self)=0 and ;            Static_State(Self) ) ) ;            Forward Get Validate_Value sCode to iRVal
11009>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (sCode<>Current_Code(Self)) ;            Get Find_Value sCode to iRVal
11013>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iRVal // OK
11014>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
