11034>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Find_Value String Code Returns Integer
11036>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iCodeField iDescField iDSO iIndex iTypeField
11036>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to iDSO
11037>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File         to iFile
11038>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Ordering          to iIndex
11039>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field        to iCodeField
11040>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iDescField
11041>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Field        to iTypeField
11042>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Initialize_File
11043>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
