11058>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // internal
11058>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Store_Current_Data Integer iFile Integer iCodeField Integer iDescField
11060>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sVal
11060>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Field_Value iFile iCodeField to sVal
11063>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_Code to (trim(sVal))
11064>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If iDescField Begin
11066>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Field_Value iFile iDescField to sVal
11069>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Current_Description to (trim(sVal))
11070>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
11070>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11070>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_RowId to (GetRowId(iFile))
