11072>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11072>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Next_Code_Record Returns Boolean
11074>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iCodeField iDescField iIndex
11074>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTypeField
11074>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sTypeValue sFoundTypeValue
11074>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound
11074>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDSO
11074>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Load_Object  to hoDSO
11075>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iDescField
11076>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field        to iCodeField
11077>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File         to iFile
11078>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
11078>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoDSO Begin
11080>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Next_Code_record of hoDSO to bFound
11081>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
11081>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11081>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
11082>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Ordering to iIndex
11083>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Vfind iFile iIndex GT
11085>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (Found) to bFound
11086>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If bFound Begin
11088>>>>>>>>>>>>>                // if found see if we are at the end of the valid list of types
11088>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Type_Field to iTypeField
11089>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Type_Value to sTypeValue
11090>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If ((iTypeField<>0) and (sTypeValue<>"")) Begin
11092>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get_Field_Value iFile iTypeField to sFoundTypeValue
11095>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(sTypeValue)=Trim(sFoundTypeValue)) to bFound
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11096>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If bFound Begin
11098>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Store_Current_Data iFile iCodeField iDescField
11099>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
11099>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11099>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bFound
11100>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
11101>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11101>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Fill_List
11103>>>>>>>>>>>>>        RowID riId
11103>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound
11103>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sCode sDesc
11103>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Static_State(Self)=0 or No_Fill_State(Self)) ;            Procedure_Return
11106>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
11106>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Delete_Data
11107>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Initialize_File
11108>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
11109>>>>>>>>>>>>>        While bFound
11113>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Current_Code        to sCode
11114>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Current_Description to sDesc
11115>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Current_RowId       to riId
11116>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Table_Value sCode sDesc riId
11117>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
11118>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
11119>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11119>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Table_Loaded_State to True
11120>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11121>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11121>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Fill_From_List Integer iObj Integer iMsg
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iItem
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        RowID   riId
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sCode sDesc
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
11123>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iObj=0 or iMsg=0) ;            Procedure_Return
11126>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
11126>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Static_State(Self) and No_Fill_State(Self)=0 ) ;            Forward Send Request_Fill_From_List iObj iMsg
11130>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
11131>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Main_File to iFile
11132>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Initialize_File
11133>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
11134>>>>>>>>>>>>>            While bFound
11138>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Current_Code        to sCode
11139>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Current_Description to sDesc
11140>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Current_RowId       to riId
11141>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send iMSG to iObj iItem sCode sDesc iFile riId
11142>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Increment iItem
11143>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Next_Code_Record to bFound
11144>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Loop
11145>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11145>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
11145>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11145>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11146>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
