11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Interface:
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//  Procedure Initialize_File Integer File# Integer Index# Integer Code# ;
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//                            Integer Desc# Integer Type# String Type
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      This initializes the data-set for finding. You MUST pass all five
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      parameters here. They are:
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//          File#  -  main file to use
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//         Index#  - Index to use for finding
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//          Code#  - field number of the code
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//          Desc#  - field number of the code's description
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//          Type#  - field number of the constraining Type (0 if none)
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//           Type  - the constrain type value ('' = allow all records)
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      You MUST send this message before finding records. Alternately,
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      you could set the individual properties and send rebuild_constraints
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      and CLEAR to initalize the file (see code on how to do this).
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//    Get Next_Code_record to ret_Int
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      Returns the next record number. 0 if no more. If record exists it
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      sets the value of Current_Code and Crnt_Description.
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//    Get Current_Code to Ret_String
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//    Get Crnt_Description to Ret_String
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      Returns the code and description of the last valid record found
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//      with the Next_Code_Record Message
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//   Sample Usage:  This was created primarily to be used by the
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//                  radio-entry-form classes. In particular those using
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//                  the "code" look up file. Look at those packages if
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//                  you wish to use them yourself.
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Use Data_Set.pkg
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
11147>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class Code_Loader_Data_Set is a DataSet
11148>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11148>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object Integer Img#
11150>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object Img#
11152>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // These should be set by the Initialize_File message
11152>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Type_Value           '' // assume no defaults.
11153>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Type_Field           0  // These values should be
11154>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Code_Field           0  // set by initialize_file
11155>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Description_Field    0  //
11156>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
11156>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // These are SET by Next_Code_Record. You may GET their values
11156>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Current_Code         ''
11157>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  Current_Description  ''
11158>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11159>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11159>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // If a Type exists (not a '') and there is a type field and a
11159>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // main_file constrain to the type. Else no constraints
11159>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnConstrain
11161>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sType
11161>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
11161>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Value to sType
11162>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File  to iFile
11163>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Type_Field to iField
11164>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sType<>'' and iFile<>0 and iField<>0) ;            Vconstrain iFile iField eq sType
11169>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  This initializes the data-set for finding. You MUST pass all five
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  parameters here. They are:
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //     File#  -  main file to use
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //    Index#  - Index to use for finding
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //     Code#  - field number of the code
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //     Desc#  - field number of the code's description
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //     Type#  - field number of the constraining Type (0 if none)
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //      Type  - the constrain type value ('' = allow all records)
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
11170>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Initialize_File Integer File# Integer Index# Integer Code# ;            Integer Desc# Integer Type# String Type
11172>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // note: all params are required!
11172>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Main_File         to File#
11173>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Ordering          to Index#
11174>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Code_Field        to Code#
11175>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Description_Field to Desc#
11176>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Type_Field        to Type#
11177>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Type_Value        to Type
11178>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
11178>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Rebuild_Constraints // set up constraints
11179>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Clear               // initialize the file
11180>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
11181>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11181>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Find the next record: Return 0 if no record, 1 if record exists
11181>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   if record exists set Current_Code and Current_Description
11181>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
11181>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Next_Code_Record Returns Boolean
11183>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
11183>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
11183>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find GT (Main_File(Self)) (Ordering(Self))
11184>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If not (Found) ;            Function_Return False
11187>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set properties Current_code and Current_Description
11187>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File to iFile
11188>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
11188>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Code_Field to iField
11189>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue
11192>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_Code to sValue
11193>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
11193>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Description_Field to iField
11194>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue
11197>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Current_Description to sValue
11198>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
11199>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
11200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
11200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
