11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Mixin class to support transistion support for CodeType and CodeMast files.
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// These files used to be in filelist and they used to reside at 207 and 208 and they
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// were always opened with "open as"
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// We want these to be in the filelist at 253 and 254. These open methods will attempt to open these files
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// as such. If these are old files (not in filelist or wrong number) they will get loaded with the old
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// open as - thus keeping this backwards compatible.
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// By adding to filelist, we can sort the files and we can open them as other database sources.
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Use VDFBase.pkg
11201>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
