13020>>>>>>>>>>>    // This procedure is being used by DEOs when they need to copy the item-
13020>>>>>>>>>>>    // options from the Data_Set. When the filenumber being passed is not
13020>>>>>>>>>>>    // equal to the Main_File of this Data_Set, then the Foreign_Field_Options
13020>>>>>>>>>>>    // will be applied.
13020>>>>>>>>>>>    Function File_Field_Options Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Integer
13022>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDSO
13022>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMain_File
13022>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iOpts
13022>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRB
13022>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iType
13022>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File to iMain_File
13023>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iFile <> iMain_File) ;            Get Data_Set iFile to iDSO
13026>>>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move Self to iDSO
13028>>>>>>>>>>>        If iDSO Begin
13030>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Field_Options of iDSO iField to iOpts
13031>>>>>>>>>>>            // we consider the item to be foreign if the DDO main file is different than the one
13031>>>>>>>>>>>            // passed and we do not allow foreign (parent) new records to be saved.
13031>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iFile<>iMain_File and Allow_Foreign_New_Save_State(iDSO)=0) ; // Add Foreign_Field_Options                Move (iOpts ior Foreign_Field_Options(iDSO, iField)) to iOpts
13034>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return iOpts
13035>>>>>>>>>>>        End
13035>>>>>>>>>>>>
13035>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
