15029>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Send Request_Assign iFile
15031>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15031>>>>>>>>>>>>
15031>>>>>>>>>>>
15031>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bOpOk) Begin
15033>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoDD) Begin
15035>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (Found) to bFound
15036>>>>>>>>>>>                Send OnPostFind of hoDD DDFindRequestAssign bFound
15037>>>>>>>>>>>                Move bFound to Found
15038>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15038>>>>>>>>>>>>
15038>>>>>>>>>>>        End
