15160>>>>>>>>>>>
15160>>>>>>>>>>>    // Augmented to return true if a non-constrained parent DD has a change. This way
15160>>>>>>>>>>>    // Should_Save_row only filters changes in a consrained parent.
15160>>>>>>>>>>>
15160>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Should_Save_Row Returns Boolean
15162>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bShouldSaveRow bShouldSave bRelatesToConstraint
15162>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServers iServer iServerFile
15162>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServerDD
15162>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Get Should_Save_Row to bShouldSaveRow // will be true if this DD is changed or has a changed parent.
15164>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Should_Save to bShouldSave // will be true if there is a change anywhere up the entire save structure
15165>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bShouldSaveRow) and bShouldSave) Begin
15167>>>>>>>>>>>            // If here we have a changed in an server but not the this DD. We need a further refinement. If the server
15167>>>>>>>>>>>            // change is in a constrained server, we don't consider this a change because you can switch rows without losing
15167>>>>>>>>>>>            // data (with RT changes made for 17.0).
15167>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server_Count to iServers
15168>>>>>>>>>>>            For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
15174>>>>>>>>>>>>
15174>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set_Server iServer to hoServerDD
15175>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Should_Save of hoServerDD to bShouldSave
15176>>>>>>>>>>>                If bShouldSave Begin
15178>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get Main_File of hoServerDD to iServerFile
15179>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsRelatesToConstrained iServerFile to bRelatesToConstraint
15180>>>>>>>>>>>                    If not bRelatesToConstraint Begin
15182>>>>>>>>>>>                        Function_Return True
15183>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
15183>>>>>>>>>>>>
15183>>>>>>>>>>>                End
15183>>>>>>>>>>>>
15183>>>>>>>>>>>            Loop
15184>>>>>>>>>>>>
15184>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15184>>>>>>>>>>>>
15184>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bShouldSaveRow
15185>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
15186>>>>>>>>>>>
15186>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns true if any relates-to constraining server needs a save. Normally there will be
15186>>>>>>>>>>>    // one or zero related-to parents. If Should_Save_Row returns false it is possible that there
15186>>>>>>>>>>>    // is a change up the relates-to constrained branch. If so, this will return True. This can be
15186>>>>>>>>>>>    // used to better determine the changed status of your DDO sructure
15186>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ShouldSaveConstrainedToServer Returns Boolean
15188>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bShouldSave bRelatesToConstraint
15188>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServers iServer iServerFile
15188>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServerDD
15188>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count to iServers
15189>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
15195>>>>>>>>>>>>
15195>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server iServer to hoServerDD
15196>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Main_File of hoServerDD to iServerFile
15197>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsRelatesToConstrained iServerFile to bRelatesToConstraint
15198>>>>>>>>>>>            If bRelatesToConstraint Begin
15200>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Should_Save of hoServerDD to bShouldSave
15201>>>>>>>>>>>                If bShouldSave Begin
15203>>>>>>>>>>>                    Function_Return True
15204>>>>>>>>>>>                End
15204>>>>>>>>>>>>
15204>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15204>>>>>>>>>>>>
15204>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
15205>>>>>>>>>>>>
15205>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
15206>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
15207>>>>>>>>>>>
15207>>>>>>>>>>>    Function FindServerInformationElement Integer iFile Returns Integer
15209>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation[] ServerInformation
15209>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation[] ServerInformation
15210>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation ServerSearch
15210>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation ServerSearch
15210>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
15210>>>>>>>>>>>        Move iFile to ServerSearch.iParent
15211>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pServerInformation to ServerInformation
15212>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (SearchArray(ServerSearch,ServerInformation))
15213>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
15214>>>>>>>>>>>
15214>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AddServerData Integer iFile Integer eParam Boolean bValue
15216>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation[] ServerInformation
15216>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation[] ServerInformation
15217>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
15217>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
15217>>>>>>>>>>>
15217>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pServerInformation to ServerInformation
15218>>>>>>>>>>>        Get FindServerInformationElement iFile to iIndex
15219>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex=-1) Begin
15221>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (SizeOfArray(ServerInformation)) to iIndex
15222>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iFile to ServerInformation[iIndex].iParent
15223>>>>>>>>>>>            // defaults must always be false!
15223>>>>>>>>>>>            Move False to ServerInformation[iIndex].bParentNoSwitchIfCommitted
15224>>>>>>>>>>>            Move False to ServerInformation[iIndex].bAllowNullParent
15225>>>>>>>>>>>            Move False to ServerInformation[iIndex].bNoCascadeDelete
15226>>>>>>>>>>>            Move False to ServerInformation[iIndex].bCascadeDeleteNullTheParent
15227>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15227>>>>>>>>>>>>
15227>>>>>>>>>>>
15227>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eParam=0) Begin
15229>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bValue<>ServerInformation[iIndex].bAllowNullParent) Begin
15231>>>>>>>>>>>                Move bValue to ServerInformation[iIndex].bAllowNullParent
15232>>>>>>>>>>>                Send AdjustDeleteValidateStructure iFile
15233>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15233>>>>>>>>>>>>
15233>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15233>>>>>>>>>>>>
15233>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (eParam=1) Begin
15236>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bValue to ServerInformation[iIndex].bParentNoSwitchIfCommitted
15237>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15237>>>>>>>>>>>>
15237>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (eParam=2) Begin
15240>>>>>>>>>>>            Move bValue to ServerInformation[iIndex].bNoCascadeDelete
15241>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15241>>>>>>>>>>>>
15241>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin // (3)
15242>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bValue<>ServerInformation[iIndex].bCascadeDeleteNullTheParent) Begin
15244>>>>>>>>>>>                Move bValue to ServerInformation[iIndex].bCascadeDeleteNullTheParent
15245>>>>>>>>>>>                Send AdjustDeleteValidateStructure iFile
15246>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15246>>>>>>>>>>>>
15246>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15246>>>>>>>>>>>>
15246>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pServerInformation to ServerInformation
15247>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
15248>>>>>>>>>>>
15248>>>>>>>>>>>    Function GetServerData Integer iFile Integer eParam Returns Boolean
15250>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bValue
15250>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation[] ServerInformation
15250>>>>>>>>>>>        tDDServerInformation[] ServerInformation
15251>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
15251>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pServerInformation to ServerInformation
15252>>>>>>>>>>>        Get FindServerInformationElement iFile to iIndex
15253>>>>>>>>>>>        // when not found in array, we want to make sure that we return false. Therefore
15253>>>>>>>>>>>        // false should always be the default.
15253>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex<>-1) Begin
15255>>>>>>>>>>>            If (eParam=0) Begin
15257>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ServerInformation[iIndex].bAllowNullParent to bValue
15258>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15258>>>>>>>>>>>>
15258>>>>>>>>>>>            Else If (eParam=1) Begin
15261>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ServerInformation[iIndex].bParentNoSwitchIfCommitted to bValue
15262>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15262>>>>>>>>>>>>
15262>>>>>>>>>>>            Else If (eParam=2) Begin
15265>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ServerInformation[iIndex].bNoCascadeDelete to bValue
15266>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15266>>>>>>>>>>>>
15266>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
15267>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ServerInformation[iIndex].bCascadeDeleteNullTheParent to bValue
15268>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15268>>>>>>>>>>>>
15268>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15268>>>>>>>>>>>>
15268>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bValue
15269>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
15270>>>>>>>>>>>
15270>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AdjustDeleteValidateStructure2
15272>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount i
15272>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
15272>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bVisited
15272>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Visited_State to True
15273>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Cascade_Delete_Structure_Validated_State to False
15274>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count to iCount
15275>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (iCount-1)
15281>>>>>>>>>>>>
15281>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server i to hoDDO
15282>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Visited_State of hoDDO to bVisited
15283>>>>>>>>>>>            If (not(bVisited)) Begin
15285>>>>>>>>>>>                Send AdjustDeleteValidateStructure2 of hoDDO
15286>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15286>>>>>>>>>>>>
15286>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
15287>>>>>>>>>>>>
15287>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
15288>>>>>>>>>>>
15288>>>>>>>>>>>    // This is called in the unlikely case that NullParent/CascadeNull are set dynamically. It
15288>>>>>>>>>>>    // tells the parent DDO to recheck its validate-delete structure and it tells all ancestors of
15288>>>>>>>>>>>    // this parent to do the same. If called while DDOs are being created (via a class setting) there
15288>>>>>>>>>>>    // will not be a connected parent for iFile, which is fine.
15288>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AdjustDeleteValidateStructure Integer iFile
15290>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
15290>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Which_Data_Set iFile to hoDDO
15291>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoDDO Begin
15293>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Initialize_Visited of hoDDO False False
15294>>>>>>>>>>>            Send AdjustDeleteValidateStructure2 of hoDDO
15295>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15295>>>>>>>>>>>>
15295>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
15296>>>>>>>>>>>
15296>>>>>>>>>>>    // Used to add a null parent to the list of parents that allow this
