15347>>>>>>>>>>>
15347>>>>>>>>>>>    // return an array with the server path from this DD to passed top. The top will be
15347>>>>>>>>>>>    // in 0 and its child in 1, grand-child in 2, etc. If empty, no path was found. To start
15347>>>>>>>>>>>    // this process the byref hoDDs array MUST be empty
15347>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure DDOServerPath Handle hoTop Handle[] ByRef hoDDs
15349>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
15349>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServers iServer
15349>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoTop=Self) Begin
15351>>>>>>>>>>>            Move Self to hoDDs[SizeOfArray(hoDDs)]
15352>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
15353>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15353>>>>>>>>>>>>
15353>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count to iServers
15354>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
15360>>>>>>>>>>>>
15360>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server iServer to hoServer
15361>>>>>>>>>>>            Send DDOServerPath of hoServer hoTop (&hoDDs)
15362>>>>>>>>>>>            If (SizeOfArray(hoDDs)) Begin
15364>>>>>>>>>>>                Move Self to hoDDs[SizeOfArray(hoDDs)]
15365>>>>>>>>>>>                Procedure_Return
15366>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15366>>>>>>>>>>>>
15366>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
15367>>>>>>>>>>>>
15367>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
15368>>>>>>>>>>>
15368>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns True if the value passed can be considered empty for this field.
15368>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsEmptyField Integer iField String sValue Returns Boolean
15370>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iDataType iValidationType
15370>>>>>>>>>>>        Number nNum
15370>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bInvalid bChecked
15370>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File to iFile
15371>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_TYPE of iFile iField to iDataType
15374>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDataInvalid iDataType sValue to bInvalid
15375>>>>>>>>>>>        If bInvalid Begin
15377>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
15378>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15378>>>>>>>>>>>>
15378>>>>>>>>>>>
15378>>>>>>>>>>>        // DDs set checkbox fields to the False value as default. We must test its select_state
15378>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Field_Validation_Type of (Field_Attributes(Self)) iField to iValidationType
15379>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValidationType=FA_VALIDATION_TYPE_CHECKBOX) Begin
15381>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Field_Select_State iField to bChecked
15382>>>>>>>>>>>            If not bChecked Begin
15384>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return True
15385>>>>>>>>>>>            End
15385>>>>>>>>>>>>
15385>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15385>>>>>>>>>>>>
15385>>>>>>>>>>>
15385>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((iDataType=DF_BCD or iDataType=DF_DATE) and (Number(sValue)=0)) Begin
15387>>>>>>>>>>>            Move "" to sValue
15388>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15388>>>>>>>>>>>>
15388>>>>>>>>>>>        Else If (iDataType=DF_DATETIME and IsNullDateTime(cast(sValue,DateTime))) Begin
15391>>>>>>>>>>>            Move "" to sValue
15392>>>>>>>>>>>        End
15392>>>>>>>>>>>>
15392>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (sValue="")
15393>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
15394>>>>>>>>>>>
15394>>>>>>>>>>>
15394>>>>>>>>>>>    // is the record committed
