16650>>>>>>>// The cVDFInternetSession class is considered private. All WBOs talk to this
16650>>>>>>>// by sending messages to the ghInetSession handle but this entire interface is
16650>>>>>>>// is private. All public access is defined in the WBOs and in the cWebApp object
16650>>>>>>>//
