16786>>>>>>>    // This object's container (cWebApp) must understand these
16786>>>>>>>    // DoAttach and Detach messages.
16786>>>>>>>    Procedure OnAttachSession DWord ByRef dwError
16788>>>>>>>        Set peDetachEndPointEnvironment to WebAppEnvNone
16789>>>>>>>        
16789>>>>>>>        Delegate Get DoAttachProcess to dwError
16791>>>>>>>        
16791>>>>>>>        If (dwError) Begin
16793>>>>>>>            Abort
16794>>>>>>>>
16794>>>>>>>        End
16794>>>>>>>>
16794>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
