16800>>>>>>>    
16800>>>>>>>    Procedure OnDetachSession
16802>>>>>>>        //  Store WebAppEnvironment for usage in OnReleaseProcess
16802>>>>>>>        Set peDetachEndPointEnvironment to (CurrentWebAppEnvironment(Self))
16803>>>>>>>        
16803>>>>>>>        Delegate Send DoDetachProcess
16805>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
16806>>>>>>>    
16806>>>>>>>    Procedure OnReleaseProcess
16808>>>>>>>        Integer iCount iObjectCount iId
16808>>>>>>>        
16808>>>>>>>        //  For ASP we ignore the OnReleaseProcess since it is not reliable
16808>>>>>>>        If (peDetachEndPointEnvironment(Self) = WebAppEnvASP) ;            Procedure_Return
16811>>>>>>>        
16811>>>>>>>        Get HttpH_Count to iObjectCount
16812>>>>>>>        
16812>>>>>>>        For iCount From 0 To (iObjectCount-1)
16818>>>>>>>>
16818>>>>>>>            Get HttpH_ID iCount to iId
16819>>>>>>>            Send OnReleaseProcess of iId
16820>>>>>>>        Loop
16821>>>>>>>>
16821>>>>>>>
16821>>>>>>>        Get Wso_Count to iObjectCount
16822>>>>>>>        
16822>>>>>>>        For iCount From 0 To (iObjectCount-1)
16828>>>>>>>>
16828>>>>>>>            Get Wso_ID iCount to iId
16829>>>>>>>            Send OnReleaseProcess of iId
16830>>>>>>>        Loop
16831>>>>>>>>
16831>>>>>>>        
16831>>>>>>>        Delegate Send DoReleaseProcess
16833>>>>>>>        
16833>>>>>>>        Set peDetachEndPointEnvironment to WebAppEnvNone
16834>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
