17171>>>>>// This contains the most basic interfaces needed for a Web Application. It is mixed into
17171>>>>>// cWebApp and cWebAppBasic.
17171>>>>>Class cWebAppBase_Mixin is a Mixin
17172>>>>>    
17172>>>>>    Procedure Define_cWebAppBase_Mixin
17174>>>>>        Integer iTemp
17174>>>>>        Handle hoCmdLine
17174>>>>>        
17174>>>>>        Property Integer peAttachStatus C_asUndefined
17175>>>>>        
17175>>>>>        // An Application object must exist for WebApp to work. If missing, this is a fatal programming error
17175>>>>>        If (ghoApplication=0) Begin
17177>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$MissingApplicationObject
17178>>>>>>
17178>>>>>            Abort
17179>>>>>>
17179>>>>>        End
17179>>>>>>
17179>>>>>
17179>>>>>        // WebApp uses the command line object to process arguments. We will send countOfArgs
17179>>>>>        // to force the command-line object to get all arguments and load the in the object.
17179>>>>>        // This removes the argument...so you cannot use cmdline anywhere in a WebApp
17179>>>>>        Get phoCommandLine of ghoApplication to hoCmdLine
17180>>>>>        Get CountOfArgs of hoCmdLine to iTemp
17181>>>>>        
17181>>>>>        Object oVDFInetSession is a cVDFInternetSession
17183>>>>>        End_Object
17184>>>>>        
17184>>>>>    End_Procedure
