17509>>>>>// This function converts a typed value from the generic format appropriate for transport to
17509>>>>>// the DataFlex format for that type.
17509>>>>>//
17509>>>>>// For example a date value should be converted from XML transport format
17509>>>>>// for dates. e.g. European "2013-03-24" is converted into "24/03/2013"
17509>>>>>//                 USA      "2013-03-24" is converted into "03/24/2013"
17509>>>>>//
17509>>>>>// This function is intended to be used when receiving numeric or date values from
17509>>>>>// the client during an AJAX call in a Web Framework application.
17509>>>>>//
17509>>>>>// This function is used internally by the framework to convert psValue Web Properties.
17509>>>>>//
17509>>>>>// eDataType - Must be passed to inform this function how to interpret the passed value (sValue)
17509>>>>>// sValue    - Is the value to be converted.
17509>>>>>// Returns   - The converted value.
17509>>>>>//
17509>>>>>// See also ConvertToClient
17509>>>>>Function ConvertFromClient Global Integer eDataType String sValue Returns String
17511>>>>>    // Test if the value represents a number, date or datetime. If so we must convert
17511>>>>>    // the value from a universal format sent by the client....
17511>>>>>    Case Begin
17511>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeNumber)
17513>>>>>            // don't convert if psValue = "", otherwise "" will convert to "0".
17513>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
17515>>>>>                ConvertFromXml xsNumber sValue to sValue
17516>>>>>            End
17516>>>>>>
17516>>>>>            Case Break
17517>>>>>        
17517>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDate)
17520>>>>>            ConvertFromXml xsDate sValue to sValue
17521>>>>>            Case Break
17522>>>>>        
17522>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDateTime)
17525>>>>>            ConvertFromXml xsDatetime sValue to sValue
17526>>>>>            Case Break
17527>>>>>        
17527>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeTime)
17530>>>>>            ConvertFromXml xsTime sValue to sValue
17531>>>>>            Case Break
17532>>>>>        
17532>>>>>    Case End
17532>>>>>    
17532>>>>>    Function_Return sValue
17533>>>>>End_Function
17534>>>>>
