17534>>>>>// This function converts a DataFlex format value into a generic format appropriate for
17534>>>>>// transport to the client.
17534>>>>>//
17534>>>>>// For example a date value should be converted into XML transport format
17534>>>>>// for dates. e.g. European "24/03/2013" is converted into "2013-03-24"
17534>>>>>//                 USA      "03/24/2013" is converted into "2013-03-24"
17534>>>>>//
17534>>>>>// This function is intended to be used when sending numeric or date values to
17534>>>>>// the client during an AJAX call in a Web Framework application.
17534>>>>>//
17534>>>>>// This function is used internally by the framework to convert psValue Web Properties.
17534>>>>>//
