17534>>>>>//
17534>>>>>// See also ConvertFromClient.
17534>>>>>Function ConvertToClient Global Integer eDataType String sValue Returns String
17536>>>>>    // Test if the value represents a number, date or datetime. If so we must convert
17536>>>>>    // the value into a universal format for transferring it to the client....
17536>>>>>    Case Begin
17536>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeNumber)
17538>>>>>            // don't convert if psValue = "", otherwise "" will convert to "0".
17538>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
17540>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsNumber sValue to sValue
17541>>>>>            End
17541>>>>>>
17541>>>>>            Case Break
17542>>>>>        
17542>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDate)
17545>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
17547>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsDate sValue to sValue
17548>>>>>            End
17548>>>>>>
17548>>>>>            Case Break
17549>>>>>        
17549>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeDateTime)
17552>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
17554>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsDatetime sValue to sValue
17555>>>>>            End
17555>>>>>>
17555>>>>>            Case Break
17556>>>>>        
17556>>>>>        Case (eDataType = typeTime)
17559>>>>>            If (sValue <> "") Begin
17561>>>>>                ConvertToXml xsTime sValue to sValue
17562>>>>>            End
17562>>>>>>
17562>>>>>            Case Break
17563>>>>>        
17563>>>>>    Case End
17563>>>>>    
17563>>>>>    Function_Return sValue
