17658>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Send Call_PostOnCallEnd (&cctx)
17659>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (cctx.bCancel) Begin
17661>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Send Call_CancelWithError (&cctx)
17662>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Procedure_Return
