17729>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Call_ParseRequestBody tWebCallContext ByRef cctx
17731>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoRequest
17731>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17731>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to Err
17732>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17732>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Parse message
17732>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Member of cctx.hoJsonRequest "r" to hoRequest
17733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Ideally we'd leave pbRequireAllMembers on as it provides more strict validation, lets see if we get away with that
17733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set pbRequireAllMembers of hoRequest to False  
17733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get JsonToDataType of hoRequest to cctx.request
17734>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Destroy of hoRequest
17735>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17735>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Err) Begin
17737>>>>>>>>>>>>>            //  Response will be HTTP 200 but with WAF error instruction
17737>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move False to cctx.bSuccess
17738>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
17738>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (pbLogInvalidRequests(Self)) Begin
17740>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_WEBAPP_BAD_REQUEST "Invalid request data. Error while parsing request body."
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17741>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
