17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>/*The administration of web properties at runtime is now optimized so and deduplicated at class level. So each cWebObject instance holds a reference to a cWebClassPropertyData object that stores the web property data for its class. Optionally it can also have a second cWebPropertyMetaData object that stores web properties created at object level.*/
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>/*Represents a single web property, is used for storage and to pass a web property reference arround.  */
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>Struct tWebPropMetaData
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Handle hmSetter     //  Setter message
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Handle hmGetter     //  Getter message
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>    String sName        //  Name with proper casing
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Integer eType       //  Property type (cArgInt, cArgStr, cArgArray, cArgStruct, ...)
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Integer eMode       //  Web property mode (wptClient, wptServerPage, wptServerSession, wptClientProtected)
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>    String sDefault     //  Initial value of the property 
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Struct
