17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>/*Maintains administration of web properties. Stores them in a sorted array for quick access.*/
17857>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebPropertyMetaData_mixin is a Mixin
17858>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
