17860>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property tWebPropMetaData[] paWebPropertyMeta
17861>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
17862>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
17862>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RegisterWebProperty Handle hmGetter Handle hmSetter String sName Integer iType Integer eMode String sOptDefault
17864>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebPropMetaData newProp
17864>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebPropMetaData newProp
17864>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebPropMetaData[] details
17864>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebPropMetaData[] details
17865>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iPos
17865>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
17865>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hmSetter to newProp.hmSetter
17866>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get paWebPropertyMeta to details
17867>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (BinarySearchArray(newProp, details, False)) to iPos
17868>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iPos = -1) Begin
17870>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (BinarySearchInsertPos()) to iPos
