18151>>>>>>>>>    // Checks whether the object is dynamic. Relies on the fact that 'phoOwner'
18151>>>>>>>>>    // will only be set for dynamic objects. Therefore, the property should
18151>>>>>>>>>    // never be set for regular objects.
18151>>>>>>>>>    Function IsDynamicObject Returns Boolean
18153>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOwner
