18153>>>>>>>>>        
18153>>>>>>>>>        Get Owner to hoOwner
18154>>>>>>>>>        If (hoOwner <> Self) ;            Get IsDynamicObjectContainer of hoOwner to bRes
18157>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Move False to bRes
18159>>>>>>>>>        
18159>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bRes
18160>>>>>>>>>    End_Function  
18161>>>>>>>>>    
18161>>>>>>>>>    
18161>>>>>>>>>    // Checks if the webobject is loaded to the client by asking the owner.
18161>>>>>>>>>    Function IsLoaded Returns Boolean
18163>>>>>>>>>        
18163>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOwner hoNeighborhood
18163>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIsLoaded
18163>>>>>>>>>        
18163>>>>>>>>>        Move False to bIsLoaded
