18169>>>>>>>>>            Get Owner to hoOwner
18170>>>>>>>>>            Get IsLoaded of hoOwner to bIsLoaded
18171>>>>>>>>>        End
18171>>>>>>>>>>
18171>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
18172>>>>>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborHood to hoNeighborhood
18173>>>>>>>>>            If (hoNeighborhood <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
18175>>>>>>>>>                Get IsLoaded of hoNeighborhood to bIsLoaded
18176>>>>>>>>>            End
18176>>>>>>>>>>
18176>>>>>>>>>        End
18176>>>>>>>>>>
18176>>>>>>>>>            
18176>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bIsLoaded
18177>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
