18711>>>>>>>>>    // Called for each cWebObject during LoadView or LoadWebApp. The event is called before the published
18711>>>>>>>>>    // properties are serialized. Can be used to:
18711>>>>>>>>>    // - Modify an Object's published properties as a view is being loaded,
18711>>>>>>>>>    // - Call client actions to be executed after the view/webapp is loaded,
18711>>>>>>>>>    // - Set web properties as the view/webapp is loaded.
18711>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnLoad
18713>>>>>>>>>        // Stub: User event hook
18713>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
