18783>>>>>>>>>    
18783>>>>>>>>>    // Registers this cWebControl in pChildWebControls array of parent control.
18783>>>>>>>>>    // Override this method to prevent registering a cWebControl
18783>>>>>>>>>    // (see also RegisterChildWebObject)
18783>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RegisterThisWebObject
18785>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoWebNeighborhood
18785>>>>>>>>>        
18785>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Send RegisterChildWebObject Self              // register the control with parent container
18787>>>>>>>>>        
18787>>>>>>>>>        Send OwnerRegisterWebObject of (Owner(Self)) Self   // register control in cWebControlLocator
18788>>>>>>>>>        
18788>>>>>>>>>        // Get the web neighborhood object handle. This is used to test which neighborhood 'scope'
18788>>>>>>>>>        // the cWebObject belongs to....
18788>>>>>>>>>        Get WebNeighborhood to hoWebNeighborhood  // delegate to nearest neighborhood object (cWebApp or cWebWindow)
18789>>>>>>>>>        Set phoWebNeighborhood to hoWebNeighborhood
18790>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
