18817>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
18817>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aChildWebControls
18818>>>>>>>>>        
18818>>>>>>>>>        Get paChildWebControls to aChildWebControls
18819>>>>>>>>>        Move (SearchArray(hoChild, aChildWebControls)) to iIndex
18820>>>>>>>>>        
18820>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex <> -1) ;            Function_Return True
18823>>>>>>>>>        Else ;            Function_Return False
18825>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
