19259>>>>>>>>>    // Returns the object handle of the first child web control with a data binding
19259>>>>>>>>>    // matching the passed Table.column (file & field). 
19259>>>>>>>>>    //
19259>>>>>>>>>    // This is a Recursive Function, you call it the first time passing the object 
19259>>>>>>>>>    // handle of a cWebView (or other window) as hoParent. It will recursively
19259>>>>>>>>>    // search the children of the view. It is assumed the view itself is not the
19259>>>>>>>>>    // object we are looking for.
19259>>>>>>>>>    //
19259>>>>>>>>>    // hoParent - Is the view containing the cWebControl objects to be searched.
19259>>>>>>>>>    // iFile  - Is the data binding table number we are looking for.
19259>>>>>>>>>    // iField - Is the data binding column we are looking for.
19259>>>>>>>>>    // Returns - The object handle of the first matching child web control.
19259>>>>>>>>>    Function FirstControlWithDataBinding Integer iFile Integer iField Returns Handle
19261>>>>>>>>>        Integer iTestFile iTestField
19261>>>>>>>>>        Integer i icWebObject
19261>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataBindable
19261>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoTarget
19261>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aChildWebControls
19262>>>>>>>>>        
19262>>>>>>>>>        // Iterate and test the parent's children....
19262>>>>>>>>>        Get paChildWebControls to aChildWebControls
19263>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aChildWebControls)) to icWebObject
19264>>>>>>>>>        
19264>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icWebObject - 1)
19270>>>>>>>>>>
19270>>>>>>>>>            Get pbDataBindable of aChildWebControls[i] to bDataBindable
19271>>>>>>>>>            
19271>>>>>>>>>            If (bDataBindable) Begin
19273>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_File  of aChildWebControls[i] to iTestFile
19274>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Field of aChildWebControls[i] to iTestField
19275>>>>>>>>>                
19275>>>>>>>>>                If ((iTestFile = iFile) and (iTestField = iField)) Begin
19277>>>>>>>>>                    Function_Return aChildWebControls[i]
19278>>>>>>>>>                End
19278>>>>>>>>>>
19278>>>>>>>>>            End
19278>>>>>>>>>>
19278>>>>>>>>>        Loop
19279>>>>>>>>>>
19279>>>>>>>>>        
19279>>>>>>>>>        // If we got to this point then we need to look deeper by recursing
19279>>>>>>>>>        // into the child objects....
19279>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icWebObject - 1)
19285>>>>>>>>>>
19285>>>>>>>>>            Get FirstControlWithDataBinding of aChildWebControls[i] iFile iField to hoTarget
19286>>>>>>>>>            
19286>>>>>>>>>            If (hoTarget <> C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
19288>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return hoTarget
19289>>>>>>>>>            End
19289>>>>>>>>>>
19289>>>>>>>>>        Loop
19290>>>>>>>>>>
19290>>>>>>>>>        
19290>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return C_WebUnresolvedObject
19291>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
