19901>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19901>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitLocalizationProperties
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This is called by Construct_Object. We perform these property settings in a separate routine
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // so that the Studio's parser does not parse the Set Property statements at the end. Parsing
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // these Set statements would cause the properties to be shown read-only in the properties panel.
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDateSeparator iDecimalSeparator iThousandsSeparator iDateFormat
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sDateFormat sCurrencySymbol sDateSeparator sDecimalSeparator sThousandsSeparator
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19903>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Default_Currency_Symbol()) to sCurrencySymbol
19904>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19904>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DECIMAL_SEPARATOR   to iDecimalSeparator
19907>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_THOUSANDS_SEPARATOR to iThousandsSeparator
19910>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DATE_SEPARATOR      to iDateSeparator
19913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get_Attribute DF_DATE_FORMAT         to iDateFormat
19916>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19916>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(iDecimalSeparator))   to sDecimalSeparator
19917>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(iThousandsSeparator)) to sThousandsSeparator
19918>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (Character(iDateSeparator))      to sDateSeparator
19919>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19919>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Case Begin
19919>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_USA)
19921>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("mm/dd/yyyy") to sDateFormat
19922>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
19923>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19923>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_EUROPEAN)
19926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("dd/mm/yyyy") to sDateFormat
19927>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
19928>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19928>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case (iDateFormat = DF_DATE_MILITARY)
19931>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ("yyyy/mm/dd") to sDateFormat
19932>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Break
19933>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Case End
19933>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19933>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDecimalSeparator   to sDecimalSeparator
19934>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psThousandsSeparator to sThousandsSeparator    
19935>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psCurrencySymbol     to sCurrencySymbol
19936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDateFormat         to sDateFormat
19937>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDateTimeFormat     to (sDateFormat * "hh:mm:ss")
19938>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDateSeparator      to sDateSeparator
19939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Sends navigateRefresh to the client to reload the web application.
19940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This will clear all loaded views and zero all web properties. You would
19940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // send this message to restart the WebApp and trigger a new user login.
19940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // See also "UnloadView" method of cWebView.
19940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NavigateRefresh
19942>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "navigateRefresh"
19943>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Opens a new URL in: current browser or new tab or new window.
19944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // sURL           - Is the URL to navigate to.
19944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // eBrowserTarget - Determines where the URL will be shown. Can be one of:
19944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                  btCurrentWindow, btNewTab, btNewWindow
19944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure NavigateToPage String sURL Integer eBrowserTarget
19946>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
19947>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19947>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sURL                     to aParams[0]
19948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (String(eBrowserTarget)) to aParams[1]
19949>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "navigateToPage" aParams
19950>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19951>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19951>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Client Action: Opens the URL in a new window.
