19958>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19959>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19959>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Shows a message in a modal dialog on the client. When called multiple times 
19959>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  the dialogs are shown after each other (not on top of each other).
19959>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowInfoBox String sMessage String sOptCaption
19961>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams
19962>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19962>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sMessage to aParams[0]
19963>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments >= 2) Begin
19965>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sOptCaption to aParams[1]
19966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
19967>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_$Information to aParams[1]
19968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
19968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ClientAction "showInfoBox" aParams        
19969>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
19970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
19970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Client Action: Shows a message box on the client and passes it an object name and method 
19970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  name that will Handle the result. The result will be an Integer indicating which button is 
19970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  clicked.
19970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowMessageBox Handle hoObj Handle hoReturnMsg String sMessage String sOptCaption String sOptLabelCSSClass Integer eOptDefaultButton String[] asOptButtons
19972>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] aParams aButtons 
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sReturnMethod
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebValueTree tVT
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //  Search for publiced reutrn message
19974>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get WebMethodName of hoObj hoReturnMsg to sReturnMethod
19975>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
19975>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sReturnMethod <> "") Begin
19977>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectName of hoObj to aParams[0]    //  Translate handle to object name
19978>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sReturnMethod         to aParams[1]    //  Translate message id to method name
19979>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sMessage              to aParams[2]    //  Determine further parameters 
19980>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           
19980>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
19982>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move sOptCaption       to aParams[3]
19983>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19983>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19983>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
19984>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$Information    to aParams[3]
19985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
19985>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 4) Begin
19987>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move sOptLabelCSSClass to aParams[4]
19988>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19988>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19988>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
19989>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move ""                to aParams[4]
19990>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19990>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19990>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
19990>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 5) Begin
19992>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move eOptDefaultButton to aParams[5]
19993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19993>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
19994>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move 0                 to aParams[5]
19995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
19995>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (num_arguments > 6) Begin
19997>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move asOptButtons to aButtons
19998>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
19998>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
19998>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
19999>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$Yes       to aButtons[0]
20000>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move C_$No        to aButtons[1]
20001>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
20001>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20001>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
20001>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            //  Add client action
20001>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClientAction "showMessageBox" aParams aButtons            
20002>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20002>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20002>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20003>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20003>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Shows a message box with yes and no buttons.
20003>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ShowYesNo Handle hoCallBack Handle hmCallback String sMessage String sOptCaption Integer eOptDfltBtn
20005>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sCSSClass sCaption
20005>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String[] ButtonTextArray
20006>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDflt
20006>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20006>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$Yes to ButtonTextArray[0]
20007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move C_$No to ButtonTextArray[1]
20008>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20008>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (num_arguments > 3) Begin
20010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sOptCaption to sCaption
20011>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20011>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20011>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move C_$Confirm  to sCaption
20013>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20013>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20013>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
20013>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (Num_Arguments > 4) Begin
20015>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move eOptDfltBtn to eDflt
20016>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20016>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20016>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20017>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>           Move 2 to eDflt //cmNo to eDflt
20018>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20018>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20018>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20018>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move "WebMsgBoxConfirm" to sCSSClass // assume this defines any images and other features for a yes/no dialog.    
20019>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
20019>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send ShowMessageBox hoCallBack hmCallback sMessage sCaption sCSSClass eDflt ButtonTextArray
20020>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
20021>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
20021>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Shows a message box with yes and no buttons.
