20622>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
20622>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
20622>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
20622>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
20624>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
20624>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
20624>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
20625>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
20631>>>>>>>>>>>>
20631>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
20632>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
20633>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
20634>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
20635>>>>>>>>>>>>
20635>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
