20636>>>>>>>>>>>    // standard helper used for all verify save, delete, clear confirmation
20636>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure VerifyRequest Handle hmCallBack Handle hmVerifyMsg
20638>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hmVerifyRequest
20638>>>>>>>>>>>        Get hmVerifyMsg to hmVerifyRequest // this is the verify message for this operation
20639>>>>>>>>>>>        If hmVerifyRequest Begin
20641>>>>>>>>>>>            // if a verify message exists call it passing the callback message
20641>>>>>>>>>>>            Send hmVerifyRequest hmCallBack
20642>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20642>>>>>>>>>>>>
20642>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
20643>>>>>>>>>>>            // if no verify message, just execute the callback with a yes
20643>>>>>>>>>>>            Send hmCallBack cmYes
20644>>>>>>>>>>>        End
20644>>>>>>>>>>>>
20644>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
