21001>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kFind_Next           Send Find_Next          PRIVATE
21002>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kEnd_of_Data         Send Find_Last          PRIVATE
21003>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSave_Record         Send Request_Save       PRIVATE
21004>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSuper_Find          Send SuperFind          PRIVATE
21005>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSuper_Find_Next     Send SuperFind_Next     PRIVATE
21006>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        On_Key kSuper_Find_Previous Send SuperFind_Previous PRIVATE
21007>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Auto_Save_State      False
21008>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Auto_Clear_DEO_State True
21009>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21010>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Find_GE
21012>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find GE True
21013>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21014>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21014>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Find_Next
21016>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find GT True
21017>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21018>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21018>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Find_Previous
21020>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find LT True
21021>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // 3/22/2002: Added find_first and Find_last. Previously this
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // was accomplished by sending beginning_of_data and end_of_data. The
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // problem with that message is that it had multiple meaning. In a edit
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // or grid, it means go to top/bottom of file. In forms, it means first
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // last record. Since we can not change this without breaking existing
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // programs we will create a message that *always* does a find first/last
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // record. This can be used in tool bars (or anywhere) to consistently provide
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // the same behavior.
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21022>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Find_First
21024>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find FIRST_RECORD False // param is false because entry-update is not needed
21025>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21026>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21026>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Find_Last
21028>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find LAST_RECORD False
21029>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21030>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuperFind
21032>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_SuperFind GE
21033>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21034>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21034>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuperFind_Next
21036>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_SuperFind GT
21037>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21038>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21038>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SuperFind_Previous
21040>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_SuperFind LT
21041>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21042>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21042>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Wrapping Returns Integer
21044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
21044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // if this is a child of a DEO, it will be saved by child_wrapping.
21044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // however, if this is not a child of a DEO, and we are wrapping,
21044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // and auto_save is true, save.
21044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
21044>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(component_state(Self)) and ;            auto_save_state(Self)) ;            Send request_Save
21047>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return 0
21048>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Returns True to indicate that this DEO supports the Find mixin protocol. This is used by menu items
21049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  to determine if you are within a DEO control finding obejct and should therefore send a DEO message.
21049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
21049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Deo_Find_Object Returns Boolean
21051>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
21052>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21053>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Supports:
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - User changable value.
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Apply DD attributes (Field Options, Mask, Datatyle, length, etc.
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - DDO request interface (Request_Find, Next, Previous, First, Last, Save, Delete, Clear, etc).
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>//
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Not Supported:
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>// - Set Currency_Mask and Set Numeric_Mask interfaces are not supported. This is a confusing interface
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>//   as it sets several properties and it is not possible to model in the Studio. It is better and more
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>//   clear to just set each individual property as required psMask, peDataType and piMaxLength.
21054>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebBaseDEO is a cWebBaseControl
21055>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21055>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
21057>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
21059>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21059>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // these can be set via entry_item command....
21059>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Data_File 0    // The binding table
21060>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Data_Field 0   // The binding table column
21061>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean private_pbIgnoreOnValueChanged False   // Used when setting Field_Changed_Value on the DDO. This prevents processing the resulting File_Field_Value_Changed event.
21062>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoPrompt 0
21063>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21063>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set true to stop DEOs from web-setting pbEnabled statically based
21063>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // on the state of the DDO
21063>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbEnabledStatic False        
21064>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21064>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties....
21064>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbCapslock C_WebDefault     // True if DD_Capslock. Set by data binding.
21067>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbChanged False             // True if the value was changed on the client
21070>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbFieldDefault False        // True if the value was set as a default value (Field_Default_Value)
21073>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbRequired C_WebDefault     // True if a non-null value is required to be entered. Set by data binding.
21076>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peAlign C_WebDefault        // Text alignment - alLeft, alRight, alCenter  ("not" set by DDO data binding. Usually the datatype will automatically determine the alignment but this property can override the automatic alignment)
21079>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer peDataType C_WebDefault     // Determines the data type of the control's psValue data. Set by data binding.
21082>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbLimitDateRange True       // If true the client will limit dates to fit the DataFlex Date type (0001-01-01 -- 2500-01-1). Setting this to false can cause conversion errors.
21085>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21085>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piMaxLength C_WebDefault    // Max number of characters that can be entered into this control. Set by data binding.
21088>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer piPrecision C_WebDefault    // Max number of numbers that can be entered after the decimal point for a numeric data type.
21091>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMask ""                    // The mask string for this control. Set by data binding.
21094>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psValue ""                   // The value that is displayed in the control. Note: depending on the peDataType, the value may be formatted for data transfer, e.g. for typeDate, value is stored in universal format for transferring dates: yyyy-mm-dd.
21097>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21097>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbHasControlError False    // Indicates it the client is showing errors, used as optimization to prevent a ClearControlErrors to be sent for every field cahnge
21100>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21100>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbServerOnValidate C_WebDefault
21103>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnValidate ""
21106>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbServerOnChange False
21109>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnChange ""
21112>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21112>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer pbServerOnAutoFind C_WebDefault
21115>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psClientOnAutoFind ""
21118>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21118>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbNoUpdateIfHidden True
21119>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbNoFillIfHidden True
21120>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21120>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbDataBindable to True
21121>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21122>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21122>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Import_Class_Protocol find_edit_mixin
21123>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21123>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Mark as DEO
21123>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DEO_Object Returns Boolean
21125>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // all web objects should understand this message. Will be set True in sub-classes
21125>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
21126>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21127>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21127>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Mark as DEO
21127>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DEO_Control_Object Returns Boolean
21129>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
21130>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21131>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21131>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Called to check if filling the DEO with data is allowed. Calls AllowFillDEO to determine.
21131>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function FillDEOAllowed Returns Boolean
21133>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAllow
21133>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21133>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move True to bAllow
21134>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send AllowFillDEO (&bAllow)
21135>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21135>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bAllow
21136>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21137>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21137>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Called to check if updating the DD with data is allowed. Calls AllowUpdateDD to determine.
21137>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function UpdateDDAllowed Returns Boolean
21139>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAllow
21139>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21139>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move True to bAllow
21140>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send AllowUpdateDD (&bAllow)
21141>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21141>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bAllow
21142>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21143>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21143>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21143>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Sent after each DEO Object has been attached to its DDO server and had all the DDO field settings
21143>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // applied to its published properties. We will set default values to any cWebControl properties that
21143>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // are still unassigned...
21143>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure AfterAttachDDO
21145>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iValue
21145>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
21145>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21145>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Set default values for any unassigned properties
21145>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbServerOnAutoFind to iValue
21146>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21148>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbServerOnAutoFind to False
21149>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21149>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21149>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21149>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbCapslock to iValue
21150>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21152>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbCapslock to False
21153>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21153>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21153>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21153>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbRequired to iValue
21154>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21156>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set pbRequired to False
21157>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21157>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21157>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21157>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get peDataType to iValue
21158>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21160>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set peDataType to typeASCII
21161>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21161>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21161>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21161>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get piMaxLength to iValue
21162>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21164>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set piMaxLength to 32768
21165>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21165>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21165>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21165>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get piPrecision to iValue
21166>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21168>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set piPrecision to 0
21169>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21169>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21169>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21169>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psMask to sValue
21170>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sValue = String(C_WebDefault)) Begin
21172>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set psMask to ""
21173>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21173>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21173>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21174>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21174>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Augmented to set all of the various properties controlled by the DDO. This is triggered when a data-bound
21174>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // control 
21174>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Attach_Deo_To_Server
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iMaxLength iPrecision iDDOOptions iValue
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eFieldType eMaskType eDataType iValidateMSG
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sMask sLabel sTooltip sValue
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAutoFind bAutoFindGE bCapslock bRequired bNoEnter bZeroSuppress bFindRequired
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAutoLabelState bStatic
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO hoFileDDO
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21176>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Attach_Deo_To_Server
21178>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21178>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDDO
21179>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
21180>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
21181>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21181>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // If we are attached to a data binding then apply all the data dictionary attributes....
21181>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoDDO <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
21183>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set of hoDDO iFile to hoFileDDO    // Get the file's DDO
21184>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21184>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Field Options
21184>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Options of hoDDO iFile iField to iDDOOptions
21185>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_AutoFind, iDDOOptions))      to bAutoFind
21186>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_AutoFind_GE, iDDOOptions))   to bAutoFindGE
21187>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_CapsLock, iDDOOptions))      to bCapslock
21188>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoEnter, iDDOOptions))       to bNoEnter
21189>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_Required, iDDOOptions))      to bRequired
21190>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_Zero_Suppress, iDDOOptions)) to bZeroSuppress
21191>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_FindReq, iDDOOptions))       to bFindRequired
21192>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21192>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Set the DEO properties....
21192>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbServerOnAutoFind to iValue
21193>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21195>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbServerOnAutoFind to (bAutoFind or bAutoFindGE)
21196>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21196>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21196>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21196>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbCapslock to iValue
21197>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21199>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbCapslock to bCapslock
21200>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21200>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21200>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21200>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbRequired to iValue
21201>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21203>>>>>>>>>>>>>                /*                We do not set pbRequired for parent fields because this will prevent clearing of                 the parent using autofind. We will set pbServerOnValidate to true so that the DD                 will still give the error when tabbing out of the field (the DD also looks at the                 changed-state to determine if it is really nessecary).                */
21203>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbRequired to (bRequired and (hoFileDDO = hoDDO))
21204>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21204>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21204>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21204>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbEnabledStatic to bStatic
21205>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (not(bStatic) and bNoEnter) Begin
21207>>>>>>>>>>>>>                // Only disable if bNoEnter is True. Otherwise respect the current pbEnabled state...
21207>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbEnabled to False
21208>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21208>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21208>>>>>>>>>>>>>           
21208>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // handle tool tip...
21208>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psToolTip to sToolTip
21209>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (sToolTip = "") Begin    // only change the tooltip if it is not already set
21211>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get File_Field_Status_Help of hoDDO iFile iField to sToolTip
21212>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psToolTip to sToolTip
21213>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21213>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21213>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21213>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Set peDataType, psMask, piMaxLength, piPrecision
21213>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_TYPE   of iFile iField to eFieldType    // the type of the column
21216>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_LENGTH of iFile iField to iMaxLength    // max number of characters of the column
21219>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Mask_Type of hoDDO iFile iField to eMaskType    // the type specified in the DDO
21220>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Mask      of hoDDO iFile iField to sMask        // the mask string specified in the DDO
21221>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21221>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case Begin
21221>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eFieldType = DF_BCD)
21223>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get_Attribute DF_FIELD_PRECISION of iFile iField to iPrecision
21226>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move typeNumber to eDataType 
21227>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
21228>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   
21228>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eFieldType = DF_DATE)
21231>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move typeDate to eDataType
21232>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move 10 to iMaxLength
21233>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
21234>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   
21234>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eFieldType = DF_DATETIME)
21237>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move typeDateTime to eDataType
21238>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move 26 to iMaxLength              // should be enough for "mm/dd/yyyy hh:mm:ss.fff pm"
21239>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
21240>>>>>>>>>>>>>          
21240>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eFieldType = DF_ASCII)
21243>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case Else
21243>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move typeASCII to eDataType
21244>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
21245>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case End           
21245>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21245>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if the mask is blank but the field type is numeric or currency
21245>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // we will build an automatic mask based on our default mask
21245>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (eMaskType = Mask_Numeric_Window or eMaskType = Mask_Currency_Window and sMask = '') Begin
21247>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (eMaskType = Mask_Numeric_Window) Begin
21249>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Field_Number_Default_Mask( iFile, iField, "*")) to sMask
21250>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21250>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21250>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
21251>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Field_Number_Default_Mask( iFile, iField, "&curren;,*;(&curren;,*)")) to sMask
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // If zero-suppress add a "Z" to first char of mask only if Z is not already there.
21252>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bZeroSuppress) Begin
21254>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If ((sMask <> "") and (Left(sMask,1) <> "Z") ) Begin
21256>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move ("Z" + sMask) to sMask
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Enable server side validation if Field_Validate_msg available
21257>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to iValidateMSG
21258>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoDDO = hoFileDDO) Begin    // If this is not a "foreign-field"
21260>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Field_Validate_msg of hoDDO iField to iValidateMSG
21261>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21261>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21261>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21261>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get pbServerOnValidate to iValue
21262>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21264>>>>>>>>>>>>>                //  We enable pbServerOnValidate for required parent fields because they can't use client-side pbRequired validation
21264>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set pbServerOnValidate to ((iValidateMSG <> 0) or bFindRequired or (bRequired and (hoFileDDO <> hoDDO)))
21265>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21265>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21265>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21265>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Set the DEO properties
21265>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get peDataType to iValue
21266>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21268>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set peDataType to eDataType
21269>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21269>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21269>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21269>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piMaxLength to iValue
21270>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21272>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set piMaxLength to iMaxLength
21273>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21273>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21273>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21273>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get piPrecision to iValue
21274>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iValue = C_WebDefault) Begin
21276>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set piPrecision to iPrecision
21277>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21277>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21277>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21277>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psMask to sValue
21278>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (sValue = "") Begin
21280>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set psMask to sMask
21281>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21281>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21281>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21281>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21281>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21282>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21282>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21282>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Private: Returns the autofind mode for the column's data binding.
21282>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // (See DoAutoFind)
21282>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function AutoFindMode Returns Integer
21284>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD 
21284>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iOpts bOn
21284>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21284>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
21285>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
21286>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
21287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21287>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoDD <> 0 and iFile <> 0) Begin
21289>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Options of hoDD iFile iField to iOpts
21290>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21290>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If ((iOpts iand DD_AUTOFIND_GE) = DD_AUTOFIND_GE) ;                Function_Return amAutoFindGE
21293>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else If ((iOpts iand DD_AUTOFIND) = DD_AUTOFIND) ;                Function_Return amAutoFindEQ
21297>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21297>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21297>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return amNoAutoFind
21298>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21299>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21299>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21299>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // this will be sent by the Entry_item command
21299>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Bind_Data Integer iFile Integer iField
21301>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_File to iFile
21302>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Data_Field to iField
21303>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21304>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21304>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21304>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required DD/DEO interface
21304>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Checkbox_Item_State Integer iItem Returns Integer
21306>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // not used in cWebControl
21306>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function  
21307>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21307>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ConvertFromTransport Handle hmGetter String sValue Integer eType Returns String
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This function converts a Web Property value from the generic format appropriate for
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // transport. For example a data value should be converted from XML transport format 
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // for dates. e.g. European "2013-03-24" is converted into "24/03/2013"
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //                 USA      "2013-03-24" is converted into "03/24/2013"
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // The parameters sName, sValue are the property name and property value being sent from the client.
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Returns the property value that is converted to server format.
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // For most properties this function does nothing. You can augment this function to do special
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // conversions for new WebProperties that you create.
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // See also ConvertToTransport.
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sReturn
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDataType
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21309>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Get ConvertFromTransport hmGetter sValue eType to sReturn
21311>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21311>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Test for special property "psValue"....
21311>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hmGetter = RefFunc(psValue)) Begin
21313>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Test if the value represents a number, date or datetime. If so we must convert
21313>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // the value into a universal format for transferring it to the client....
21313>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get peDataType to eDataType   // If the object supports psValue it should also support peDataType. If not peDataType will get delegated to ghoWebApp and return typeASCII.
21314>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Note: For efficienty we do not WebGet peDataType! In other words we do not
21314>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // get the "synchronized copy of peDataType (if there is one). This is much more
21314>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // efficient but it also assumes that a control's peDataType does not change 
21314>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // dynamically. This should be OK....
21314>>>>>>>>>>>>>            CVTLOCALIZATION ON      //  WebGet turns localization OFF, but for psValue we want it ON as this is a string property
21315>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    //  Note: This means that we have to keep CVTLOCALIZATION private, since we now turn it ON twice 
21315>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    //  while turning it OFF once. That is no problem as it never goes below 0, until other code will start using it.
21315>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (ConvertFromClient(eDataType, sValue)) to sReturn
21316>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21316>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21316>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21316>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21316>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sReturn
21317>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21318>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21318>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ConvertToTransport Handle hmGetter Variant vValue Integer iType  Returns String
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This function converts a Web Property value into a generic format appropriate for
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // transport to the client. For example a data value should be converted into XML transport format 
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // for dates. e.g. European "24/03/2013" is converted into "2013-03-24"
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //                 USA      "03/24/2013" is converted into "2013-03-24"
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // The parameters sName, sValue are the property name and property value being sent to the client.
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Returns the property value that is converted for transport.
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // For most properties this function does nothing. You can augment this function to do special
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // conversions for new WebProperties that you create.
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // See also ConvertFromTransport.
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sReturn
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eDataType
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Test for special property "psValue"....
21320>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hmGetter = RefFunc(psValue)) Begin
21322>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Test if the value represents a number, date or datetime. If so we must convert
21322>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // the value into a universal format for transferring it to the client....
21322>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get peDataType to eDataType   // If the object supports psValue it should also support peDataType. If not peDataType will get delegated to ghoWebApp and return typeASCII.
21323>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Note: For efficienty we do not WebGet peDataType! In other words we do not
21323>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // get the "synchronized copy of peDataType (if there is one). This is much more
21323>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // efficient but it also assumes that a control's peDataType does not change 
21323>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // dynamically. This should be OK....
21323>>>>>>>>>>>>>            CVTLOCALIZATION ON      //  SerializeObject turns localization OFF, but for psValue we want it ON as this is a string property
21324>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        //  Note: This means that we have to keep CVTLOCALIZATION private, since we now turn it ON twice 
21324>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        //  while turning it OFF once. That is no problem as it never goes below 0, until other code will start using it.
21324>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (ConvertToClient(eDataType, vValue)) to sReturn
21325>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21325>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21325>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
21326>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Get ConvertToTransport hmGetter vValue iType  to sReturn
21328>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21328>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21328>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21328>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sReturn
21329>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21330>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21330>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21330>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // These are needed because Get Data_File and Get Data_Field expects the Item interface to be present
21330>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // so these cannot be declared as straight properties.        
21330>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_File Integer iItem Integer iFile
21332>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set private_Data_File to iFile
21333>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21334>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21334>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Data_Field Integer iItem Integer iField
21336>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set private_Data_Field to iField
21337>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21338>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21338>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_File Integer iItem Returns Integer
21340>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (private_Data_File(Self))
21341>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21342>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21342>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Data_Field Integer iItem Returns Integer
21344>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (private_Data_Field(Self))
21345>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21346>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21346>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Performs an autofind if there is an autofind DD setting and the field is changed.
21346>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // As soon as a succuessful autofind occurs, the field is reset.
21346>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure DoAutoFind
21348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer bChanged eAuto iCur
21348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD hoServer 
21348>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] hoDDs
21349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
21349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bAllowNull bNull bNoFindOnMain
21349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iStat
21349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
21349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21349>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21350>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
21351>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
21352>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21352>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoServer <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
21354>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21354>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // We only do an autofind check if the DD field value is changed and it is an autofind field
21354>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    
21354>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Changed_state of hoServer iFile iField to bChanged
21355>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bChanged) Begin
21357>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get AutoFindMode to eAuto
21358>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (eAuto<>0) Begin
21360>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDD
21361>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   If (hoDD and hoDD<>hoServer) Begin
21363>>>>>>>>>>>>>                       Get Field_Current_Value of hoDD iField to sValue
21364>>>>>>>>>>>>>                       Get IsEmptyField of hoDD iField sValue to bNull
21365>>>>>>>>>>>>>                       // if this is an empty value this may be a null parent. See if the
21365>>>>>>>>>>>>>                       // child that is below this parent supports null parents for this file
21365>>>>>>>>>>>>>                       If bNull Begin
21367>>>>>>>>>>>>>                           Send DDOServerPath of hoServer hoDD (&hoDDs) // if hoDDs returns items, 0 is hoDD and 1 is its child
21368>>>>>>>>>>>>>                           If (SizeOfArray(hoDDs)) Begin
21370>>>>>>>>>>>>>                              Get IsNullParentAllowed of hoDDs[1] iFile to bAllowNull                    
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>                           End
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>                       End
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   End
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21371>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   Else Begin
21372>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        If (not(HasRecord(hoServer))) Begin
21374>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // if a main file autofind, see if we allow this with new records
21374>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Get IsViewNoFindOnMain to bNoFindOnMain
21375>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21375>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21375>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   End
21375>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21375>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   If (bNull and bAllowNull) Begin
21377>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Send Request_ClearBindingTable // if null, do a clear (essentially a find nothing)
21378>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   End
21378>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21378>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   Else If (bNoFindOnMain) Begin
21381>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // if here, this is the anti-autofind. If an autofind would succeed, it's a duplicate record error 
21381>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // This is used by drilldowns when a find or autofind is not appropriate because it
21381>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // will find a record. This should only occur with new records 
21381>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Clear iFile
21382>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // this will be a deferred (read) find.
21382>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Send File_Field_Find of hoServer EQ iFile iField True False True
21383>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Get_Attribute DF_FILE_STATUS of iFile to iStat
21386>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        If (iStat = DF_FILE_ACTIVE) Begin
21388>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Send Data_set_error of hoServer iField DFERR_ENTER_VALID_REC_ID "Duplicate Record Id not allowed"
21389>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21389>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21389>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Else Begin
21390>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Send HideAllControlErrors DFERR_ENTER_VALID_REC_ID                             
21391>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21391>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21391>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   End
21391>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21391>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   Else Begin
21392>>>>>>>>>>>>>                      Send File_Field_AutoFind of hoServer iFile iField (If(eAuto=amAutoFindGE, GE, EQ)) 
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>                   End
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21393>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21394>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21394>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21394>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21394>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Notify DEO that DDO label has changed.
21394>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure File_Field_Label_Changed Integer iFile Integer iField Boolean bLong String sLabel
21396>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Do nothing
21396>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure  
21397>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21397>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21397>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Notify DEO that DDO mask has changed.
21397>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure File_Field_Mask_Changed Integer iFile Integer iField String sMask
21399>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Do nothing
21399>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure  
21400>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21400>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //  Notify DEO that a field option has changed in the DDO.
21400>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure File_Field_Option_Changed Integer iFile Integer iField Integer iOptions Integer bClear
21402>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Do nothing
21402>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Sent by DDOs to all DEOs whenever a DDO file/field value is changed.
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // If the file/filed value matches then it means this DEO is attached to
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // the same file/Field that got changed. Set the Object's synchronized 
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // psValue according to the passed value.
21403>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure File_Field_Value_Changed Integer iFile Integer iField String sValue Integer iChangeDisabled
21405>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDataFile iDataField
21405>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSynchingFieldDefaults
21405>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21405>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Protect agains re-entrant calls....
21405>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (private_pbIgnoreOnValueChanged(Self)) Begin
21407>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
21408>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21408>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21408>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21408>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Do not process if this was triggered during synching of DD field defaults...
21408>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Get SynchingFieldDefaults to bSynchingFieldDefaults
21410>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bSynchingFieldDefaults) Begin
21412>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
21413>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21413>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21413>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21413>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iDataFile
21414>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21414>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iDataFile = iFile) Begin
21416>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iDataField
21417>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21417>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iDataField = iField) Begin
21419>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebSet psValue to sValue
21420>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send HideAllControlErrors
21421>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If not iChangeDisabled Begin
21423>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet pbChanged to True
21424>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21424>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21424>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
21425>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet pbFieldDefault to True
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21426>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21427>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21427>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21427>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure File_Field_Pointer_Value_Changed Integer iFile Integer iField Pointer pValue Integer iChangeDisabled
21429>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // called by the DD to support text fields?
21429>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDataFile iDataField
21429>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
21429>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21429>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (private_pbIgnoreOnValueChanged(Self)) Begin
21431>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
21432>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21432>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21432>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21432>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iDataFile
21433>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21433>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iDataFile = iFile) Begin
21435>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iDataField
21436>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21436>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iDataField = iField) Begin
21438>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (PointerToString(pValue)) to sValue    // get the string at this pointer value
21439>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebSet psValue to sValue
21440>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send HideAllControlErrors
21441>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
21441>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (not(iChangeDisabled)) Begin
21443>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet pbChanged to True
21444>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21444>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21444>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
21445>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    WebSet pbFieldDefault to True
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21446>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21447>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21447>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns True if the table column is configured to be "commitable".
21447>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // i.e. once saved should not be changed.
21447>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsCommitable Returns Boolean
21449>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iDDOOptions
21449>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iClients iClient iMain
21449>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoOwner hoChild     
21449>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bCommitable
21449>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21449>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
21450>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
21451>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21452>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False to bCommitable
21453>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21453>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iFile and hoServer) Begin
21455>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // the purpose is to determine if this is a commitable field....
21455>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoOwner
21456>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21456>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if this is the main file, we check the DD_Commit flag....
21456>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoOwner = hoServer) Begin 
21458>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get File_Field_Options of hoServer iFile iField to iDDOOptions
21459>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (IsFlagIn(DD_COMMIT, iDDOOptions)) to bCommitable
21460>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21460>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21460>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if this is a parent, we test for a child NoSwitchIfCommitted flag
21460>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else If (hoOwner) Begin
21463>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set_Client_Count of hoOwner to iClients
21464>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Main_File of hoOwner to iMain
21465>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move 0 to iClient
21466>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
21466>>>>>>>>>>>>>                While (not(bCommitable) and iClient < iClients)
21470>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get Data_Set_Client of hoOwner iClient to hoChild
21471>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get ParentNoSwitchIfCommitted of hoChild iMain to bCommitable
21472>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Increment iClient
21473>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Loop
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21474>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bCommitable
21475>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // If there is no data binding (no Entry_Item command) but the DEO is served by a DDO then the DEO is 
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // a calculated value. The initial data is filled by sending the OnSetCalculatedValue event. This is fired
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // whenever the DDO performs a find, clear or delete operation.
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // sValue - [out] a ByRef value which this event should fill with the calculated value.
21476>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSetCalculatedValue String ByRef sValue
21478>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // To be augmented by the user
21478>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // call to invoke a prompt list
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // with drilldown apps, we always returns 0 for PromptObject and we 
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // always do nothing with prompt. We expect you to handle this all via
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // pbPromptButton and OnPrompt. This resolves forward reference issues and
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // in the long run is more flexible
21479>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Prompt
21481>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt
21481>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eStyle
21481>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Get WebViewStyle to eStyle
21483>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eStyle=wvsDesktop or eStyle=wvsDialog) Begin
21485>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get PromptObject to hoPrompt
21486>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If hoPrompt Begin
21488>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get WebViewStyle of hoPrompt to eStyle
21489>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (eStyle =wvsDrillDown) Begin
21491>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Cannot Prompt to a drill down object from a desktop view"
21492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21492>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21492>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21492>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
21493>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Send Popup of hoPrompt Self
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>            end
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21494>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21495>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21495>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // called by prompt lists as part of callback to customize a list
21495>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Prompt_Callback Handle hoPrompt
21497>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21498>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21498>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns PromptObject. returns phoPrompt
21498>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function PromptObject Returns Handle
21500>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoPrompt
21500>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eStyle
21500>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Delegate Get WebViewStyle to eStyle
21502>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (eStyle = wvsDesktop or eStyle=wvsDialog) Begin
21504>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get phoPrompt to hoPrompt
21505>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21505>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21505>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoPrompt
21506>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function    
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>   
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Sent by DDO when there is a clear/find/save/delete.
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This should Set all necessary web properties of the control
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // For example psValue, pbEnabled, pbChanged.
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // eMode - Determines the type of DDO operation which generated this refresh message. 
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         It may be one of the following:
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear:             Used only for DEOs attached to the DDO that was the
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 "origin" of a Clear operation, (i.e., the DDO received
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 the original Clear message). All other DDOs Send their 
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 DEOs the refresh message passing mode_find_or_clear_set.  
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set: Used for DEOs attached to DDOs which have Found and/or cleared records.  
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear_All:         Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that participated in a clear_all operation.  
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Delete:            Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that performed a successful deletion. 
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 DDOs that were merely updated as the result of a deletion Use Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set.  
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Save:              Used for DEOs attached to any DDO involved in a successful Save operation. 
21507>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Refresh Integer eMode
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iDDOOptions eRTS eDataType
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bActive bAppSynching bNoEnter bCommitable
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFieldChanged
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue sOldValue
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Time tTimeVal tTimeNull
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21509>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Refresh eMode
21511>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21511>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Active_State to bActive
21512>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get AppSynching of (Host(Self)) to bAppSynching
21513>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21513>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bActive and not(bAppSynching)) Begin
21515>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Server to hoDDO
21516>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
21517>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
21518>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21518>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case Begin
21518>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eMode = MODE_FIND_OR_CLEAR_SET)
21520>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eMode = MODE_CLEAR)
21523>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eMode = MODE_CLEAR_ALL)
21526>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eMode = MODE_DELETE)
21529>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Case (eMode = MODE_SAVE)
21532>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (iFile <> 0) Begin
21534>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Get DDRefreshTableStatus iFile to eRTS // see if this table is part of the DD's request
21535>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21535>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        If (eRTS <> ddrtsNone or eMode = MODE_CLEAR_ALL or eMode = MODE_FIND_OR_CLEAR_SET) Begin
21537>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // Handle dynamic switching of Enabled_State. This would only happen if the
21537>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // file/field is commitable in the DDO....
21537>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // only do commit check if the field is design-time enabled
21537>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            If (pbEnabled(Self)) Begin
21539>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                Send SetDynamicEnabled
21540>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            End            
21540>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21540>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            
21540>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            //  Do security check
21540>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            If (not(FillDEOAllowed(Self))) Begin
21542>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                Procedure_Return
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            End
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // Refresh should read from the global file buffers unless doing a clear and there are
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // default values waiting in the DDO buffer....
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21543>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            If (eRTS = ddrtsCleared or eMode = MODE_CLEAR_ALL) Begin
21545>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // if the DD's field changed state is true, we must have a default value to use
21545>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                Get File_Field_Changed_State of hoDDO iFile iField to bFieldChanged
21546>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            End
21546>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21546>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Else Begin
21547>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                Move False to bFieldChanged
21548>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            End
21548>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21548>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21548>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            If (bFieldChanged) Begin
21550>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // The DD buffer value has changed after a clear. That means there is a default
21550>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // value to read from the DDO buffer....
21550>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                Get File_Field_Current_Value of hoDDO iFile iField to sValue
21551>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            End
21551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21551>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Else Begin
21552>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // In all other cases we read the value directly from the file buffer....
21552>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                Get_Field_Value iFile iField to sValue 
21555>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                
21555>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // If this was a DDO Clear and the value is "0" for a numeric field
21555>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // then we will Set psValue to "" instead of "0". This simulates 
21555>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                // Windows DEO behavior.
21555>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                If (eRTS = ddrtsCleared) Begin
21557>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    Get peDataType to eDataType   // If the object supports psValue it should also support peDataType. If not peDataType will get delegated to ghoWebApp and return typeASCII.
21558>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    
21558>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    If (eDataType = typeNumber and Number(sValue) = 0) Begin
21560>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                        Move "" to sValue
21561>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    End
21561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21561>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    
21561>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    If (eDataType = typeTime) Begin
21563>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                        Move (NullDateTime()) to tTimeNull
21564>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                        Move sValue to tTimeVal
21565>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                        If (tTimeNull = tTimeVal) Begin
21567>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                            Move "" to sValue
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                        End
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                    End
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>                                End
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            End
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        
21568>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Move (Rtrim(sValue)) to sValue
21569>>>>>>>>>>>>>                           
21569>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21569>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            // Set the value and changed flag web properties....
21569>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Send HideAllControlErrors
21570>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            WebSet psValue to sValue
21571>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            WebSet pbChanged to False
21572>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            WebSet pbFieldDefault to bFieldChanged // if true, a default is set
21573>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21573>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21573>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
21573>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21573>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Else Begin
21574>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        WebGet psValue to sValue
21575>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Move sValue to sOldValue
21576>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Send OnSetCalculatedValue (&sValue)
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // Set the value and changed flag web properties. In the case of a Clear
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // we will unconditionally set the value/changed flag because a clear always
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // occurs during InitForShow. During InitForShow we have no idea what is 
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // stored on the client so therefore we must make sure that the cleared
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // value is forced to update the client otherwise the current client value
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // would just stay there. 
21577>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        If (sValue <> sOldValue or eMode = MODE_CLEAR_ALL) Begin
21579>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            WebSet psValue to sValue
21580>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            WebSet pbChanged to False
21581>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            WebSet pbFieldDefault to False
21582>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21582>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
21582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21582>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Case Break
21583>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Case End
21583>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21583>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21584>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21584>>>>>>>>>>>>>    /*    Refresh event during intialization of FlexTron controls. Latches onto the current record buffer     which may not have been recently found.    */
21584>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitialRefresh
21586>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send Refresh MODE_FIND_OR_CLEAR_SET
21587>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21588>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21588>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // helper function returns true if any child DDO relates to this
21588>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsConstrainingParent Handle hoDDO Returns Boolean
21590>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iClients i iFile
21590>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoClient
21590>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRelates
21590>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoDDO to iFile
21591>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Client_Count of hoDDO to iClients
21592>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (iClients-1)
21598>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21598>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Client of hoDDO i to hoClient
21599>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsRelatesToConstrained of hoClient iFile to bRelates
21600>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If bRelates Begin
21602>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return True
21603>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21603>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21603>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
21604>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21604>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
21605>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21606>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21606>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns true if control supports prompt buttons and the prompt button
21606>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default property value (not webproperty) is enabled. Augmented in cWebBaseForm 
21606>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function HasPromptButton Returns Boolean
21608>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
21609>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21610>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21610>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // this figures out if a control *should* be dynamically enabled/disabled.
21610>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Typically used by SetDynamicEnabled to webset pbEnabled but can be called
21610>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // at any time.
21610>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsDynamicEnabled Returns Boolean
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord bNoEnter bNoPut bKeyField bDisable bAutoFind bAutoFindGe 
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bCommitable bNoFind bIsReadOnly bPromptButton
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDDOOptions
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21612>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21613>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile        
21614>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField        
21615>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(hoServer) or not (iFile)) Begin
21617>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM "Server / Data_File required"
21618>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21618>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
21619>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21619>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21619>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsViewReadOnly to bIsReadOnly
21620>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21620>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bIsReadOnly) Begin
21622>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move True to bDisable                      
21623>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21623>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21623>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
21624>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDDO
21625>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21625>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (not(hoDDO)) Begin
21627>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM "DDO for binding data_file not found"
21628>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21628>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return True
21629>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21629>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21629>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21629>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // this will handle main and foreign options but not commit options
21629>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Options of hoServer iFile iField to iDDOOptions
21630>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoEnter, iDDOOptions)) to bNoEnter
21631>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoPut, iDDOOptions)) to bNoPut
21632>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_AUTOFIND, iDDOOptions)) to bAutoFind
21633>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_AUTOFIND_GE, iDDOOptions)) to bAutoFindGe
21634>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get HasPromptButton to bPromptButton
21635>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21635>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if main file ddo
21635>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (hoServer = hoDDO) Begin
21637>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get IsViewNoFindOnMain to bNoFind
21638>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get HasRecord of hoServer to bHasRecord
21639>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get Key_Field_State of hoServer iField to bKeyField
21640>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bNoEnter) Begin
21642>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move True to bDisable                      
21643>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21643>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21643>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else If (bHasRecord and bNoFind and (bNoPut or bKeyField or bAutoFind or bAutoFindGe)) Begin
21646>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move True to bDisable                      
21647>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21647>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21647>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else If (not(bHasRecord) and bNoFind and bNoPut) Begin
21650>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move True to bDisable 
21651>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21651>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21651>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
21652>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsCommitable to bCommitable
21653>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (bCommitable) Begin
21655>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Get File_Field_Committed_Options of hoServer iFile iField to iDDOOptions  // possible NoPut, NoEnter additions
21656>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        If bNoFind Begin
21658>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Move (iDDOOptions) to bDisable
21659>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21659>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21659>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Else Begin
21660>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoEnter, iDDOOptions)) to bDisable
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // if parent
21661>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
21662>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bNoEnter) Begin
21664>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move True to bDisable
21665>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21665>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21665>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bNoPut and not(bPromptButton)) Begin
21667>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move True to bDisable
21668>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21668>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21668>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Else Begin
21669>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Get IsViewNoFindOnConstrainedParent to bNoFind
21670>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If bNoFind Begin
21672>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Get IsConstrainingParent hoDDO to bDisable
21673>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
21673>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21673>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If not bDisable Begin
21675>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Get IsCommitable to bCommitable
21676>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        If (bCommitable) Begin
21678>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Get File_Field_Committed_Options of hoServer iFile iField to iDDOOptions  // possible NoPut, NoEnter additions
21679>>>>>>>>>>>>>                            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoEnter, iDDOOptions)) to bDisable
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        End
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21680>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bDisable
21681>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
21682>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21682>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetDynamicEnabledDesktopStyle
21684>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
21684>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iDDOOPtions
21684>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDisable bNoEnter bCommitable
21684>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21684>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21685>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile        
21686>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(hoServer) or not (iFile)) Begin
21688>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
21689>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21689>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21689>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21689>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsCommitable to bCommitable
21690>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bCommitable) Begin
21692>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
21693>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_DynamicEntryOptions of hoServer iFile iField to iDDOOptions
21694>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoEnter, iDDOOptions)) to bNoEnter
21695>>>>>>>>>>>>>            WebSet pbEnabled to (not(bNoEnter))
21696>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21696>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21696>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21697>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21697>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetDynamicEnabledDrillDownStyle
21699>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
21699>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
21699>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDisable
21699>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21700>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile        
21701>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(hoServer) or not (iFile)) Begin
21703>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
21704>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21704>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21704>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21704>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsDynamicEnabled to bDisable
21705>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebSet pbEnabled to (not(bDisable))
21706>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21707>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21707>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // this websets the enabled state based on the state of the
21707>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // web view and the control. This is usually called during Refresh
21707>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SetDynamicEnabled
21709>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
21709>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bStatic
21709>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21709>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbEnabledStatic to bStatic
21710>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bStatic)) Begin
21712>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get WebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
21714>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
21716>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send SetDynamicEnabledDrillDownStyle
21717>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21717>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21717>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
21718>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send SetDynamicEnabledDesktopStyle
21719>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21719>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21719>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End                
21719>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21719>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21720>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21720>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21720>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Find Integer eFindMode
21722>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Generic request find method for handling Request_Find
21722>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // eFindMode - Can be one of... lt, le, eq, ge, gt, or it may be either Next_Record, First_Record, or Last_Record
21722>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iField iFile iMainIndex
21722>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
21722>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21722>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21723>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21723>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer <> 0) Begin
21725>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
21726>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
21727>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21727>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iFile > 0) Begin
21729>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Item_Find to hoServer eFindMode iFile iField True False False   // Entry Update = True, Show find error = True, Deferred State = False
21730>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21730>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21730>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21730>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21730>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21731>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21731>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Reads the synchronized psValue and pbChanged properties and updates the DDO data binding appropriately.
21731>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Sent if pbDataBindable is True. Called during the AJAX Call's SynchronizeDDOs stage.
21731>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure UpdateDataBinding
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iField iFile
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bChanged bDefault
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sValue
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bNoPut bNoEnter
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iDDOOptions
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21733>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(UpdateDDAllowed(Self))) Begin
21735>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
21736>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21736>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21736>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21736>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21737>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
21737>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer <> 0) Begin
21739>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
21740>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
21741>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
21741>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iFile > 0) Begin
21743>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbChanged to bChanged
21744>>>>>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbFieldDefault to bDefault
21745>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
21745>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get File_Field_DynamicEntryOptions of hoServer iFile iField to iDDOOptions
21746>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (bChanged or bDefault or IsFlagIn(DD_FORCEPUT, iDDOOptions)) Begin
21748>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    WebGet psValue to sValue
21749>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    
21749>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Set private_pbIgnoreOnValueChanged to True                        // Don't process the DDO's File_Field_Value_Changed event!
21750>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    
21750>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (bChanged) ;                        Set File_Field_Changed_Value of hoServer iFile iField to sValue   // Use File_Field because the field doesn't have to be in the server
21753>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Else If (IsFlagIn(DD_FORCEPUT, iDDOOptions)) ;                        Set File_Field_Current_Value of hoServer iFile iField to sValue
21757>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Else ;  // if bDefault                        Set File_Field_default_Value of hoServer iFile iField to sValue
21759>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21759>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move (IsFlagIn(DD_NoPut, iDDOOptions)) to bNoPut
21760>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    If (bNoPut) Begin
21762>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // this tells the DD that this is a DEO update on a noput field, which should only
21762>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        // happen with foreign index fields (noput=T,noenter=F). This stops the save update
21762>>>>>>>>>>>>>                        Set File_Field_NoPutValueChangedByDeo of hoServer iFile iField to True
21763>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    End
21763>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21763>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Set private_pbIgnoreOnValueChanged to False
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End    
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21764>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21765>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
21765>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function ExecFileFieldMessage Handle hMsg Returns Integer
21767>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField iResult
21767>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
21767>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDDO
21768>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
21769>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
21770>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoDDO <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
21772>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Exec_File_Field_Message of hoDDO iFile iField hMsg to iResult
21773>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21773>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21773>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iResult
21774>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
