21794>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iResult iFile iField
21794>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDDO
21794>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoDDO
21795>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
21796>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField       
21797>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If ((hoDDO <> 0) and (iFile <> 0)) Begin
21799>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get File_Field_Validate_Field of hoDDO iFile iField to iResult
