21807>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required DD/DEO interface. This is sent from the DD during a save Request_Validate is used to allow
21807>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // fields with DEOs bound to them to do the first validation.  
21807>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Items Boolean bNotFindReq Returns Integer
21809>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOk
21809>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoOrigin 
21809>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iMode
21809>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // DoAutoFind may do a DD find and reset these modes. Make sure the get restored
21809>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move OPERATION_MODE to iMode
21810>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move OPERATION_ORIGIN to hoOrigin
21811>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Send DoAutoFind // we must make sure autofind happens before the validation
21812>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move iMode to OPERATION_MODE
21813>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move hoOrigin to OPERATION_ORIGIN
21814>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get OnValidate to bOk
21815>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (not(bOk))
21816>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
