21817>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // performs a clear of the DD that owns the Data_File. This can be used to clear a parent
21817>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // field in a view (e.g., salesperson in order view). This is not assigned a hot key by
21817>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default and it is up to the developer to use this. We also use this with autofinds that
21817>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allow null parents. Also note that there are no data-loss messages sent for this message
21817>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added as part of null parent support.
21817>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_ClearBindingTable
21819>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
21819>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
21819>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
21820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
21821>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
21823>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClearForTable of hoServer iFile
21824>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21824>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21824>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
