21830>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
21832>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Which_Data_Set of hoServer iFile to hoDD
21833>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Field_RememberedValue of hoDD iField to sValue
21834>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
21834>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
21834>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
