21910>>>>>>>>>>>>>        WebPublishProcedure OnAutoFind
21911>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
21912>>>>>>>>>>>>>End_Class
21913>>>>>>>>>>>Use cWebObjectOwner_mixin.pkg
21913>>>>>>>>>>>
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// cWebRadio objects act in a co-ordinated way with other radio button objects as a collective "group"
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// 1 or more groups of radio buttons can live together in the same container object.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>//
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// In a radio button group there is always one button object that is the "master" and the "slaves" in that group
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// are connected to it. Which radio button is the master should be irrelevant to the developer.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// 
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// The psValue property of every radio button in a group is synchronized.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>//
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// A group is defined by creating a master radio button and connecting slave buttons to it. Any button can be
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// the master. The master button defines a group name and\or a data binding. The Data Binding and group name
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// is copied to each slave.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// 
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// A slave can be connected to a master button by...
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// a) Setting the slave's phoMasterRadio property to the master's object handle.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// b) Seting the slave's psGroupName to the same group name as the master radio button.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>//
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// A radio button cannot change radio groups dynamically. Radio groups are configured at design time and connected
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// at object creation time. Once established, a radio group should not be changed.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>//
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// An empty\null psGroupName is allowed. A null group name will be converted into the object name of the radio's
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// container web panel object. All radio buttons with a null psGroupName in the same Web Panel belong to the same group.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>//
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// Setting a radio button's data binding automatically set's its group name to "table_name.column_name".
21913>>>>>>>>>>>//
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// Groups are scoped to their view (or dialog). Button objects of the same group can be defined anywhere within
21913>>>>>>>>>>>// the same view. Buttons in one view cannot be grouped to buttons of another view.
21913>>>>>>>>>>>Class cWebRadio is a cWebBaseDEO    
21914>>>>>>>>>>>    // Construct_Object:
21914>>>>>>>>>>>    
21914>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
21916>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
21918>>>>>>>>>>>        
21918>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterRadio            // Name of the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
21921>>>>>>>>>>>
21921>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Handle phoMasterRadio 0         // Object handle to the master radio button in this group (can be self). This is either advanced or private interface.
21922>>>>>>>>>>>
21922>>>>>>>>>>>        // Published Properties....
21922>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psMasterName ""
21925>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String psGroupName ""           // All radio buttons in a view with this group name belong to the same radio button group
