22628>>>>>>>    // Adds an attachment to the response and returns the integer id.
22628>>>>>>>    //
22628>>>>>>>    // Params:
22628>>>>>>>    //  hoJsonObject    cJsonObject handle representing the attachment.
22628>>>>>>>    // Returns:
22628>>>>>>>    //  The attachment index (1 based).
22628>>>>>>>    Function AddResponseAttachment Handle hoJsonObject Returns Integer
22630>>>>>>>        Handle hoAttachments
22630>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
22630>>>>>>>        Move -1 to iIndex
22631>>>>>>>        
22631>>>>>>>        Get phoResponseAttachments to hoAttachments
22632>>>>>>>        If (hoAttachments = C_WebUnresolvedObject) Begin
22634>>>>>>>            Get Create (RefClass(cJsonObject)) to hoAttachments
22635>>>>>>>            Send InitializeJsonType of hoAttachments jsonTypeArray
22636>>>>>>>            Set phoResponseAttachments to hoAttachments
22637>>>>>>>        End
22637>>>>>>>>
22637>>>>>>>        Get MemberCount of hoAttachments to iIndex
22638>>>>>>>        Increment iIndex
22639>>>>>>>        Send AddMember of hoAttachments hoJsonObject
22640>>>>>>>        
22640>>>>>>>        Function_Return iIndex
22641>>>>>>>    End_Function
