23071>>>>>>>        /*        This array is used to cache the DDO structure of the view. It is initialized during         End_Construct_Object and is sorted alphabetically. The name is generated using the         DDIdentity which makes it unique within the view. Used for fast searches of DDO object name         to DDO handle.        */
