23085>>>>>>>     Procedure FindDataDictionaries Handle hoCurrentDD Handle[] ByRef aDDOHandles
23087>>>>>>>        // Recursive function to iterate the structure of data dictionary objects in this view
23087>>>>>>>        // returning an array of DD object handles in the ByRef parameter.
23087>>>>>>>        //
23087>>>>>>>        // To start the search call this method with hoCurrentDD set to the view's Main DD
23087>>>>>>>        // and hDataDictionaries passed as an empty array.
23087>>>>>>>        //
23087>>>>>>>        // Returns an array of DDO object handles: first the Main DD, followed by the child DD tree, then the parent DD tree
23087>>>>>>>        Handle hoNextDD
23087>>>>>>>        Integer iCounter iCount
23087>>>>>>>        
23087>>>>>>>        // Append the passed data dictionary to the array.....
23087>>>>>>>        Move hoCurrentDD to aDDOHandles[(SizeOfArray(aDDOHandles))]
23088>>>>>>>    
23088>>>>>>>        // Add the client ddo's....
23088>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Client_Count of hoCurrentDD to iCount
23089>>>>>>>        
23089>>>>>>>        For iCounter from 0 to (iCount - 1)
23095>>>>>>>>
23095>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Client of hoCurrentDD iCounter to hoNextDD
23096>>>>>>>            
23096>>>>>>>            If (SearchArray(hoNextDD, aDDOHandles) < 0) Begin
23098>>>>>>>               Send FindDataDictionaries hoNextDD (&aDDOHandles)
23099>>>>>>>            End
23099>>>>>>>>
23099>>>>>>>        Loop
23100>>>>>>>>
23100>>>>>>>        
23100>>>>>>>        // Add the server ddo's....
23100>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoCurrentDD to iCount
23101>>>>>>>        
23101>>>>>>>        For iCounter from 0 to (iCount-1)
23107>>>>>>>>
23107>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoCurrentDD iCounter to hoNextDD
23108>>>>>>>    
23108>>>>>>>            If (SearchArray(hoNextDD, aDDOHandles) < 0) Begin
23110>>>>>>>               Send FindDataDictionaries hoNextDD (&aDDOHandles)
23111>>>>>>>            End
23111>>>>>>>>
23111>>>>>>>        Loop
23112>>>>>>>>
23112>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
