23113>>>>>>>    /*    Returns unique name for DDO object within this view, which is basically the long object name     not including the view name. This allows duplicate DD object names (as long as they are not     siblings!). This name is used in the synchronization logic.    */
23113>>>>>>>    Function DDIdentity Handle hoDD Returns String
23115>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Right(Name(hoDD), Length(Name(hoDD)) - Length(Name(Self)) - 1))
23116>>>>>>>    End_Function
