23132>>>>>>>        Get WebObjectName to tDDODef.sView
23133>>>>>>>        
23133>>>>>>>        Get paDDOHandlesTree to aDDOHandles
23134>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aDDOHandles)) to icDDO
23135>>>>>>>        
23135>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (icDDO - 1)
23141>>>>>>>>
23141>>>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of aDDOHandles[i] to riRowID
23142>>>>>>>            Move (SerializeRowID(riRowID)) to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sRowID
23143>>>>>>>            Get DDIdentity aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].sName
23144>>>>>>>            Get pDDDefaults of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aRemembered 
23145>>>>>>>            If (bDynamicConstraints) Begin
23147>>>>>>>                Get Constrain_File of aDDOHandles[i] to iFile
23148>>>>>>>            End
23148>>>>>>>>
23148>>>>>>>            Else Begin
23149>>>>>>>                Move -1 to iFile
23150>>>>>>>            End
23150>>>>>>>>
23150>>>>>>>            Move iFile to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].iConstrainFile
23151>>>>>>>
23151>>>>>>>            // DD changed_state and parent changed state info
23151>>>>>>>            Get Changed_State of aDDOHandles[i] to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].bChanged
23152>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server_Count of aDDOHandles[i] to iSrvrs
23153>>>>>>>            For iSrvr from 0 to (iSrvrs-1)
23159>>>>>>>>
23159>>>>>>>                Get Data_Set_Server of aDDOHandles[i] iSrvr to hoServerDD
23160>>>>>>>                Get Main_File of hoServerDD to iTable
23161>>>>>>>                Move iTable to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].iTable
23162>>>>>>>                Get ParentDDOSwitched of aDDOHandles[i] iTable to bSwitched
23163>>>>>>>                Move bSwitched to tDDODef.aDDOs[i].aParentChanged[iSrvr].bSwitched 
23164>>>>>>>            Loop
23165>>>>>>>>
23165>>>>>>>
23165>>>>>>>                        
23165>>>>>>>        Loop
23166>>>>>>>>
23166>>>>>>>            
23166>>>>>>>        Move True to tDDODef.bA
23167>>>>>>>        
23167>>>>>>>        WebSet ptDDOStates to tDDODef
23168>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
