24029>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24029>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Triggered to clear the data between requests. Resets al data stored during a request.
24029>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24029>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ClearData
24031>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebChangedProps[] aEmptyChanged
24031>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebChangedProps[] aEmptyChanged
24032>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps[] aEmptySync
24032>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebSyncProps[] aEmptySync
24033>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebCacheAdvProp[] aEmptyAdv
24033>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tWebCacheAdvProp[] aEmptyAdv
24034>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] aEmptyHandle
24035>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iStoreIndex
24035>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24035>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
24036>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move aEmptyChanged to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex]
24037>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move aEmptySync to gaSyncProps[iStoreIndex]
24038>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move aEmptyAdv to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]
24039>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move aEmptyHandle to gaSyncObjectHandles[iStoreIndex]
24040>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24040>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set piSize to 0
24041>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set piCapacity to 0
24042>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24042>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbActive to False
