24044>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24044>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Determines if an object is in scope for WebGet / WebSet.
24044>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24044>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsObjectInCallActionScope Handle hoObject Returns Boolean
24046>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bResult
24046>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24046>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get IsInCallActionScope of hoObject to bResult
24047>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
