24191>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move sPropName              to tNew.tSvrProp.sP
24192>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tNew.tSvrProp.sO       to tNew.tSyncProp.sO
24193>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tNew.tSvrProp.sP      to tNew.tSyncProp.sP
24194>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move False                  to tNew.bChanged
