24196>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
24196>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex])) to iNew
24197>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Move tNew to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iNew]
24198>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
