24337>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24337>>>>>>>>>>>    // Called by the cWebApp when a new request comes in to initialize the client web properties. 
24337>>>>>>>>>>>    // Forwards the request to the client handler.
24337>>>>>>>>>>>    //
24337>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Call_PreWebProps tWebCallContext ByRef cctx
24339>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoHandler
