24339>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoServerHandler to hoHandler
24340>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitializeCall of hoHandler cctx.request.Header.aSyncProps cctx.request.Header.aAdvSyncP
24341>>>>>>>>>>>        
24341>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoSessionHandler to hoHandler
24342>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitializeCall of hoHandler cctx.request.Header.aSyncProps cctx.request.Header.aAdvSyncP
24343>>>>>>>>>>>        
24343>>>>>>>>>>>        Get phoClientHandler to hoHandler
24344>>>>>>>>>>>        Send InitializeCall of hoHandler cctx.request.Header.aSyncProps cctx.request.Header.aAdvSyncP
24345>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
