25047>>>>>>>        //Send DeserializeViewStack
25047>>>>>>>        WebGet paViewStack to aViewStack
25048>>>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aViewStack)) to iTop
25049>>>>>>>            
25049>>>>>>>        If (iTop > 0) Begin
25051>>>>>>>            Get WebObjectByName aViewStack[iTop-1].sViewName to hoView
25052>>>>>>>            Get IsViewChanged of hoView to aViewStack[iTop-1].bShouldSave
25053>>>>>>>            WebSet paViewStack to aViewStack
25054>>>>>>>        End
