25550>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cBaseDEO_Mixin is a Mixin
25551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25551>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Define_cBaseDEO_Mixin
25553>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25553>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean Auto_Fill_State False       // Used to tell DDO's whether first record should be found automatically after a clear.
25554>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean pbAutoFillOnInit False       // Used to tell DDO's that we want autofill on initialization when DEO is attaching
25555>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25555>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Server 0
25556>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Watched_Servers 0          // Handle to Broadcaster object broacasting tos server DDO's
25557>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // used to send Set Changed_State to "foreign" servers, while Watched_Servers
25557>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // is used for sending messages from the DDO to DEOs (there are more of them)
25557>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer ChangedStateWatched_Servers     0
25558>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_pbServersScanned 0
25559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // added to support DEO request-delegation. This is set true if the
25559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // server is explicitly set in this DEO (normally via a USING parameter).
25559>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Explicit_Server_State False
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Since this package's SET changed_state is using change_disabled_state
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // we might as well Define it here. This gets changed by Clear_mx to support
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // setting of defaults without changing the objects changed_state.
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        //
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // This stops changed_state from getting changed. It allows item_changed_state
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // to change without the object's changed_state getting changed. This Should
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // be considered protected (i.e., likely to change). The new messages Entry_Defaults
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // and Set Default_Value are both public and Use this. Try to use these messages
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // instead of this Property.
25560>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer Change_Disabled_State False
25561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25561>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean Extended_DEO_State False    // Defines DEO behavior according to Extended_DEO_State of the server DDO
25562>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25562>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Boolean Active_State False          // True when the DEO has been attached to the DDO
25563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                
25563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // these can be set via entry_item command....
25563>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Data_File 0    // The binding table
25564>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property Integer private_Data_Field 0   // The binding table column
25565>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25565>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set pbDataBindable to True
25566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25566>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25567>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25567>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnSetCalculatedValue String ByRef sValue
25569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // To be augmented by the user
25569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This procedure adds the specified object id (hoServer) to this object's
25570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // set of database agents who are merely 'watched', and establishes a
25570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // connection between the database agent and this object.
25570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
25570>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Add_Watched_Server Integer hoServer
25572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
25572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoWatchedServers
25572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Watched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25573>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoWatchedServers = 0) Begin
25575>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Create of Desktop U_Broadcaster to hoWatchedServers // modern syntax
25576>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Watched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Broadcast_State of hoWatchedServers to False
25578>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Find_Element of hoWatchedServers hoServer to iIndex
25579>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25579>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex < 0) Begin
25581>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Element to hoWatchedServers hoServer
25582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Broadcast_State of hoWatchedServers to True
25583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex < 0 and Active_State(Self)) Begin
25585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_User_Interface to hoServer Self True // TRUE for watchers
25586>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25586>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25586>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Add_ChangedStateWatched_Server Integer hoServer
25589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iIndex
25589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoWatchedServers
25589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ChangedStateWatched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoWatchedServers = 0) Begin
25592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Create of Desktop U_Broadcaster to hoWatchedServers // modern syntax
25593>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set ChangedStateWatched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Broadcast_State of hoWatchedServers to False
25595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Find_Element of hoWatchedServers hoServer to iIndex
25596>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25596>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (iIndex < 0) Begin
25598>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Element to hoWatchedServers hoServer
25599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25599>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Broadcast_State of hoWatchedServers to True
25600>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Expects the class to understand the Active_State property. Relies on the pbDataBindable interface.
25601>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Attach_Deo_To_Server
25603>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
25603>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataBindable bServerScan
25603>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoFileDDO hoWatchedServers
25603>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25603>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
25604>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File  to iFile
25605>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
25606>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataBindable to bDataBindable        
25607>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25607>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer <> 0) Begin
25609>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_User_Interface to hoServer Self
25610>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // Extended_DEO_State is used to determine whether the object receives the data binding related
25610>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            // message interface from the server DDO...
25610>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Extended_DEO_State to (Extended_DSO_State(hoServer) and bDataBindable)
25611>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25611>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25611>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25611>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get private_pbServersScanned to bServerScan
25612>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bServerScan)) Begin
25614>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Scan_Servers
25615>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25615>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25615>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25615>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Watched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25616>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoWatchedServers Begin
25618>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_User_Interface to hoWatchedServers Self True // True for watchers
25619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25619>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set Active_State to True
25620>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Changed so that this respects Change_disabled_state. I don't
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // like this here but its the best I can think of. Therefore, all
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // objects using server.pkg must understand Change_disabled_state.
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Changed to not remove from server if static.
25621>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Set Changed_State Integer newVal
25623>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer hoServer hoWatchedServers
25623>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25623>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If not (Change_Disabled_State(Self)) Begin
25625>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Forward Set Changed_State to newVal
25627>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get server to hoServer
25628>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25628>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (newVal and hoServer) Begin
25630>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Set Changed_State of hoServer to True
25631>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                // We also set changed_state of all "foreign" servers. These
25631>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                // are the ones whose Data_File is a parent File
25631>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Get ChangedStateWatched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25632>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If hoWatchedServers ;                    Set Changed_State of hoWatchedServers to True
25635>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25635>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25635>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25635>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25635>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25636>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25636>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // returns the table's status for the refresh event. A table can either be
25636>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // cleared, found or not touched by the operation. This can only be called while
25636>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // within Refresh. This was created to hide the private is_file_included command
25636>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DDRefreshTableStatus Integer iTable Returns Integer
25638>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bIncluded
25638>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        is_file_included iTable 1 to bIncluded // see if main file is in find done array
25640>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If bIncluded Begin
25642>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return ddrtsFound
25643>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25643>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25643>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        is_file_included iTable 0 to bIncluded // see if main file is in clear done array
25645>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If bIncluded Begin
25647>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return ddrtsCleared
25648>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25648>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25648>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25648>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return ddrtsNone
25649>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
25650>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25650>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   This procedure empties the Watched_Servers broadcaster, after
25650>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   detaching this object from all of the broadcaster's elements.
25650>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   This procedure is invoked by Find_Servers_to_Watch, in preparation
25650>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //   for a scan.
25650>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Delete_Watched_Servers
25652>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer hoWatchedServers
25652>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25652>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Watched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25653>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoWatchedServers Begin
25655>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Remove_User_Interface to hoWatchedServers Self True // detach from all, TRUE for watchers
25656>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set broadcast_state of hoWatchedServers to False
25657>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Data to hoWatchedServers                     // empty it
25658>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set broadcast_state of hoWatchedServers to True
25659>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25659>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25659>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25659>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ChangedStateWatched_Servers to hoWatchedServers
25660>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If hoWatchedServers Begin
25662>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set broadcast_state of hoWatchedServers to False
25663>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Delete_Data to hoWatchedServers                     // empty it
25664>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set broadcast_state of hoWatchedServers to True
25665>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25665>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25665>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25666>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25666>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Required DD/DEO interface. Indicates if this DEO is a data bindable control or a container.
25666>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // For cWebControls, this is just another way of querying pbDataBindable, used by DD's
25666>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DEO_Control_Object Returns Boolean
25668>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bDataBindable
25668>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbDataBindable to bDataBindable
25669>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return bDataBindable
25670>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
