25675>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Used to determine if the object understands the DEO interface.
25675>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Probably not used in Ajax WebApps.
25675>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DEO_Object Returns Boolean
25677>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
