25828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This adds every parent DDO for the passed DDO to the DEO's list of DDOs to watch.
25828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // It adds the parents and then does this recursively up the DDO tree.
25828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This means that this DEO will respond to any DD change for any server. This does not
25828>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure WatchAllParentServers Handle hoDDO
25830>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSrvr
25830>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iServer iServers
25830>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDDO to iServers
25831>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iServer from 0 to (iServers-1)
25837>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25837>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDDO iServer to hoSrvr
25838>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Add_Watched_Server hoSrvr
25839>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send WatchAllParentServers hoSrvr
25840>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
25841>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25841>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // return true if this message can be delegated to an explicit server
25842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function DelegateDeoRequest Returns Boolean
25844>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoServerDEO
25844>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get ServerDEO to hoServerDEO
25845>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (hoServerDEO<>0 and hoServerDEO<>Self)
25846>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
