25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Sent by DDO when there is a clear/find/save/delete.
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This should Set all necessary web properties of the control
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // For example pbEnabled.
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // eMode - Determines the type of DDO operation which generated this refresh message. 
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         It may be one of the following:
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear:             Used only for DEOs attached to the DDO that was the
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 "origin" of a Clear operation, (i.e., the DDO received
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 the original Clear message). All other DDOs Send their 
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 DEOs the refresh message passing mode_find_or_clear_set.  
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set: Used for DEOs attached to DDOs which have Found and/or cleared records.  
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Clear_All:         Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that participated in a clear_all operation.  
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Delete:            Used for DEOs attached to any DDO that performed a successful deletion. 
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //                                 DDOs that were merely updated as the result of a deletion Use Mode_Find_or_Clear_Set.  
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    //         Mode_Save:              Used for DEOs attached to any DDO involved in a successful Save operation. 
25913>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Refresh Integer eMode
25915>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25916>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25916>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // helper function returns true if any child DDO relates to this
25916>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function IsConstrainingParent Handle hoDDO Returns Boolean
25918>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iClients i iFile
25918>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoClient
25918>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRelates
25918>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Main_File of hoDDO to iFile
25919>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Client_Count of hoDDO to iClients
25920>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For i from 0 to (iClients-1)
25926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25926>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Client of hoDDO i to hoClient
25927>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get IsRelatesToConstrained of hoClient iFile to bRelates
25928>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If bRelates Begin
25930>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return True
25931>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25931>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25931>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
25932>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25932>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
25933>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
25934>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25934>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_Find Integer eFindMode
25936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Generic request find method for handling Request_Find
25936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // eFindMode - Can be one of... lt, le, eq, ge, gt, or it may be either Next_Record, First_Record, or Last_Record
25936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iField iFile iMainIndex
25936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
25936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25936>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
25937>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
25937>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer <> 0) Begin
25939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_File to iFile
25940>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Data_Field to iField
25941>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            
25941>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (iFile > 0) Begin
25943>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Send Item_Find to hoServer eFindMode iFile iField True False False   // Entry Update = True, Show find error = True, Deferred State = False
25944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
25944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25944>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
