25945>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required DD/DEO interface. This is sent from the DD during a save Request_Validate is used to allow
25945>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function Validate_Items Boolean bNotFindReq Returns Integer
25947>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // performs a clear of the DD that owns the Data_File. This can be used to clear a parent
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // field in a view (e.g., salesperson in order view). This is not assigned a hot key by
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // default and it is up to the developer to use this. We also use this with autofinds that
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // allow null parents. Also note that there are no data-loss messages sent for this message
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Added as part of null parent support.
25948>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Request_ClearBindingTable
25950>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer
25950>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile
25950>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
25951>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
25952>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoServer and iFile) Begin
25954>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send ClearForTable of hoServer iFile
25955>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
25955>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25955>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
25956>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25956>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // required DD/DEO interface
25956>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Update_Dependent_Items
25958>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // do nothing
25958>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure 
