25960>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
25960>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Set or get an attribute at driver level. These attributes, when set,
25960>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// will be set for the remainder of the session or until set again. To 
25960>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// permanently set driver level attributes change the driver           
