26045>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iRetval
26045>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
26045>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get psDriverID to sDriverID
26046>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sDRiverID <> "") Begin
26048>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (Repeat(" ", 255)) to sRegistration
26049>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Call_Driver 0 sDRiverID Function CLI_GETREGNAME Callback 0 Passing sRegistration sVoid 0 Result iRetval
26054>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
26054>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
26054>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
26054>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sRegistration
26055>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
