26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCLOSE               for 1000004
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLPREPARE             for 1000005
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLEXECUTE             for 1000006
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLEXECDIRECT          for 1000007
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLFETCH               for 1000008
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCOLUMNINFO          for 1000009
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCOLUMNVALUE         for 1000010
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLBINDFILE            for 1000011
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLGETDATA             for 1000012
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCOLSTRINGATTRIBLEN  for 1000013
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCOLSTRINGATTRIB     for 1000014
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCOLINTATTRIB        for 1000015
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLSTMTINTATTRIB       for 1000016
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLSETPROCNAME         for 1000017
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLSETPROCARG          for 1000018
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLCALL                for 1000019
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLGETPROCARGLEN       for 1000020
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLGETPROCARG          for 1000021
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLGETPROCRETVALLEN    for 1000022
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLGETPROCRETVAL       for 1000023
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLNEXTRESULTSET       for 1000024
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLBUFFERSTATUS        for 1000025
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLSETPROCSCHEMA       for 1000026
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLGETMESSAGE          for 1000027
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define FUNC_SQLSETSTMTINTATTRIB    for 1000028
