26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Embedded SQL statement attribute constants
26436>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Define SQLSTMTATTRIB_COLUMNCOUNT    for 1
