26437>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Move -1 to giLastSQLhstmt
26438>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
26438>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Struct tSQLColumn
26438>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Integer iSQLType
