27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// Manager for embedded SQL handles.                           
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// We want to be able to use multiple drivers and multiple            
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// connections within a driver and multiple statements within a       
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// connection. To allow this we have placed our own handle logic on   
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// top of the driver handle logic. This way we can handle the         
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>// situation where two driver handles may be equal.                   
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27842>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>Class cSQLHandleManager is a cObject
27843>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
27843>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_object
27845>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_object
27847>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27847>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  psDefaultDriver      ""
27848>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Property String  psDefaultConnection  ""
27849>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27849>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
