27850>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Create a cSQLConnection object
27850>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateSQLConnection Returns Handle
27852>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSQLConnection
27852>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Create (RefClass(cSQLConnection)) to hoSQLConnection
27853>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoSQLConnection
