27855>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure SQLSetConnect String sDriver String sConnect
27857>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDefaultDriver      to sDriver
27858>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Set psDefaultConnection  to sConnect
27859>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
