27860>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    
27860>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Make a connection to an embedded SQL server
27860>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Returns : The DataFlex handle to the connection
27860>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function SQLConnect String sDrvrID String sConnect Returns Integer
27862>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSQLConnection
27862>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer bOK
27862>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27862>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Check arguments
27862>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sDrvrID = "" and sConnect = "") Begin
27864>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDefaultDriver      to sDrvrId
27865>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDefaultConnection  to sConnect
27866>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
27866>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27866>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27866>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Create a cSQLConnection object
27866>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get CreateSQLConnection to hoSQLConnection
27867>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Connect to the database
27867>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get SQLConnect of hoSQLConnection sDrvrID sConnect to bOK
27868>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27868>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // If connection to the database failed, destroy the cSQLConnection object and return a 0 handle
27868>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bOK)) Begin
27870>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send DestroySQLConnection of hoSQLConnection
27871>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to hoSQLConnection
27872>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
27872>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27872>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27872>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoSQLConnection
27873>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
