27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Establish an embedded SQL connection that uses an existing connection from an earlier login or open.
27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // Existing connections are identified by there connectstring. (can be obtained with DF_DRIVER_SERVER_NAME attribute)
27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // If sConnectString exist in the list of existing connections, that connection will be used for embedded SQL.
27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // The connectstrings must be an exact match, but can be case insensitive
27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // If no matching connectstring is found, this function will return 0
27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    // This function will only work with CLI connectivity kits 6.2 or later
27884>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function SQLConnectionConnect String sDrvrID String sConnectString Returns Integer
27886>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSQLConnection
