27886>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sDrvrID = "" and sConnectString = "") Begin
27888>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDefaultDriver      to sDrvrId
27889>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get psDefaultConnection  to sConnectString
27890>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
27890>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27890>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27890>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        // Create a cSQLConnection object
27890>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get CreateSQLConnection to hoSQLConnection
