27892>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bOK)) Begin
27894>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send DestroySQLConnection of hoSQLConnection
27895>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move 0 to hoSQLConnection
27896>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
27896>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27896>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
27896>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoSQLConnection
27897>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
