27937>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function BuildFilterExpressionForField Handle hoReadingDD Integer iFile Integer iField String sSearchValue Returns String
27939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sColumnFilter
27939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoColumnDD
27939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27939>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoReadingDD = 0 or sSearchValue = "" or iFile = 0 or iField = 0) Function_Return ""
27942>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
