27943>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoColumnDD = 0) Function_Return ""
27946>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27946>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get BuildFilterExpressionForDD hoReadingDD hoColumnDD iField sSearchValue to sColumnFilter
27947>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sColumnFilter <> "") Begin
27949>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move ("(" + sColumnFilter + ")") to sColumnFilter
