27952>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function BuildFilterExpressionForFields Handle hoReadingDD Integer[] iaFiles Integer[] iaFields String sSearchValue Returns String
27954>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iCount iFile iField
27954>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sFilter sColumnFilter
27954>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27954>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoReadingDD = 0 or sSearchValue = "") Function_Return ""
27957>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27957>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        For iCount from 0 to (SizeOfArray(iaFiles) - 1)
27963>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27963>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iaFiles[iCount] to iFile
27964>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move iaFields[iCount] to iField
27965>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27965>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get BuildFilterExpressionForField hoReadingDD iFile iField sSearchValue to sColumnFilter
27966>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (sColumnFilter <> "") Begin
27968>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                If (sFilter <> "") Begin
27970>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                    Move (sFilter + " OR ") to sFilter
27971>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                End
27971>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27971>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Move (sFilter + sColumnFilter) to sFilter
27972>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
27972>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27972>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Loop
27973>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27973>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27973>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (sFilter <> "") Begin
27975>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move ("(" + sFilter + ")") to sFilter
27976>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
27976>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27976>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
27976>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sFilter
27977>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
