28569>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Function CreateItem tSelectionItem ByRef oOut String sValue Returns String
28571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bFound bErr
28571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
28571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoServer hoTable
28571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
28571>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get RefindByValue sValue (&oOut) to bFound
28572>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (bFound) ;            Function_Return True
28575>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
28575>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Server to hoServer
28576>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_Field to iField
28577>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get Data_File to iFile
28578>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get File_Field_Table_Object of hoServer iFile iField to hoTable
28579>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
28579>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (hoTable <> 0) Begin
28581>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$CannotInsertIntoValidationTable
28582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
28582>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Function_Return False
28583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
28583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
28583>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
28584>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Clear of hoServer
28585>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoServer iField to sValue
28586>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoServer to bErr
28587>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            If (bErr) Begin 
28589>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$ErrorWhileSavingNewItem
28590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
28590>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>                Function_Return False
28591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            End
28591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
28591>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoServer
28592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
28592>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move (SerializeRowID(GetRowID(iFile))) to oOut.sRowId
28593>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>            Move sValue to oOut.aValues[0]
28594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        End
28594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>
28594>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return True
28595>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
