28724>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Integer iFile iField
28724>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSelectionSource hoServer hoTable
28724>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
28724>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Get pbAllowCreate to bAllowCreate
28725>>>>>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bAllowCreate)) ;            Procedure_Return
28728>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
