28818>>>>>>>>>>>>>    Procedure InitializeCustomButtons tSelectionItem[] ByRef aItems Boolean bLast String sFilter
28820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bPaged bAllowCreate
28820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        String sText
28820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoSelectionSource
28820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tSelectionItem tCustomItem       
28820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        tSelectionItem tCustomItem       
28820>>>>>>>>>>>>>        
