29387>>>>>>>>>    Function GetAccessible Returns Integer
29389>>>>>>>>>        Integer iAccessible iAccessibleParent
29389>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bVal
29389>>>>>>>>>        
29389>>>>>>>>>        If (piAccessibilityCacheCall(Self) <> giWebAccCacheCtx) Begin
29391>>>>>>>>>            Move C_UIA_InSync to iAccessible
29392>>>>>>>>>            
29392>>>>>>>>>            If (pbNoAccessibilityCheck(Self)) Begin
29394>>>>>>>>>               Move C_UIA_All to iAccessible
29395>>>>>>>>>            End
29395>>>>>>>>>>
29395>>>>>>>>>            Else Begin
29396>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbRender to bVal
29397>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Rendered) to iAccessible
29400>>>>>>>>>                
29400>>>>>>>>>                Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Visible) to iAccessible
29401>>>>>>>>>                
29401>>>>>>>>>                WebGet pbEnabled to bVal
29402>>>>>>>>>                If (bVal) ;                    Move (iAccessible + C_UIA_Enabled) to iAccessible
29405>>>>>>>>>            End
29405>>>>>>>>>>
29405>>>>>>>>>            
29405>>>>>>>>>            Delegate Get GetAccessible to iAccessibleParent
29407>>>>>>>>>            Move (iAccessibleParent iand iAccessible) to iAccessible
29408>>>>>>>>>            
29408>>>>>>>>>            Set piAccessibilityCache to iAccessible
29409>>>>>>>>>            Set piAccessibilityCacheCall to giWebAccCacheCtx
29410>>>>>>>>>        End
29410>>>>>>>>>>
29410>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
29411>>>>>>>>>            Get piAccessibilityCache to iAccessible
29412>>>>>>>>>        End
29412>>>>>>>>>>
29412>>>>>>>>>        
29412>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return iAccessible
29413>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
