29745>>>>>>>>>    Procedure RequestColumnLookup String sSearchText
29747>>>>>>>>>        Send DDSetChangedValue sSearchText
29748>>>>>>>>>        Send Request_Find GE
29749>>>>>>>>>        If not Found Begin
29751>>>>>>>>>            Send Request_Find LT
29752>>>>>>>>>        End
29752>>>>>>>>>>
29752>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
