29828>>>>>>>>>            End
29828>>>>>>>>>>
29828>>>>>>>>>
29828>>>>>>>>>            Increment iColumn
29829>>>>>>>>>        Loop
29830>>>>>>>>>>
29830>>>>>>>>>
29830>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
29831>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
29832>>>>>>>>>
29832>>>>>>>>>    Function BuildFilter Returns String
29834>>>>>>>>>        Integer iColumn iField iFile
29834>>>>>>>>>        String sSearchValue sFilter sColumnFilter
29834>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSearchHiddenColumns bHidden
29834>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoReadingDD
29834>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] ahoColumns
29835>>>>>>>>>
29835>>>>>>>>>        WebGet psSearchTerm to sSearchValue
29836>>>>>>>>>        If (sSearchValue = "") Function_Return ""
29839>>>>>>>>>
29839>>>>>>>>>        Get ReadingServer to hoReadingDD
29840>>>>>>>>>        If (hoReadingDD = 0) Function_Return ""
29843>>>>>>>>>
29843>>>>>>>>>        Get phoColumnObjects to ahoColumns
29844>>>>>>>>>        WebGet pbSearchHiddenColumns to bSearchHiddenColumns
29845>>>>>>>>>
29845>>>>>>>>>        While (iColumn < SizeOfArray(ahoColumns))
29849>>>>>>>>>            WebGet pbHidden of ahoColumns[iColumn] to bHidden
29850>>>>>>>>>            If (bSearchHiddenColumns or not(bHidden)) Begin
29852>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_File of ahoColumns[iColumn] to iFile
29853>>>>>>>>>                Get Data_Field of ahoColumns[iColumn] to iField
29854>>>>>>>>>
29854>>>>>>>>>                If (iFile <> 0 and iField <> 0) Begin
29856>>>>>>>>>                    Get BuildFilterExpressionForField hoReadingDD iFile iField sSearchValue to sColumnFilter
29857>>>>>>>>>                    If (sColumnFilter <> "") Begin
29859>>>>>>>>>                        If (sFilter <> "") Begin
29861>>>>>>>>>                            Move (sFilter + " OR ") to sFilter
29862>>>>>>>>>                        End
29862>>>>>>>>>>
29862>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sFilter + sColumnFilter) to sFilter
29863>>>>>>>>>                    End
29863>>>>>>>>>>
29863>>>>>>>>>                End
29863>>>>>>>>>>
29863>>>>>>>>>            End
29863>>>>>>>>>>
29863>>>>>>>>>
29863>>>>>>>>>            Increment iColumn
29864>>>>>>>>>        Loop
29865>>>>>>>>>>
29865>>>>>>>>>
29865>>>>>>>>>        If (sFilter <> "") Begin
29867>>>>>>>>>            Move ("(" + sFilter + ")") to sFilter
29868>>>>>>>>>        End
29868>>>>>>>>>>
29868>>>>>>>>>
29868>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return sFilter
29869>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
