29872>>>>>>>>>        tWebListFilterState FilterState
29872>>>>>>>>>        tWebListFilterState FilterState
29872>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoDD
29872>>>>>>>>>        String sOrigFilter
29872>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bOrigActive bFilterSet
29872>>>>>>>>>
29872>>>>>>>>>        Move vFilterState to FilterState
29873>>>>>>>>>        If (not(FilterState.bDisregardFilter)) Begin
29875>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
29876>>>>>>>>>        End
29876>>>>>>>>>>
29876>>>>>>>>>
29876>>>>>>>>>        Get pbSearchSQLFilterSet to bFilterSet
29877>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bFilterSet)) Begin
29879>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
29880>>>>>>>>>        End
29880>>>>>>>>>>
29880>>>>>>>>>
29880>>>>>>>>>        Get phoSearchSQLFilterDD to hoDD
29881>>>>>>>>>        If (hoDD <> 0) Begin
29883>>>>>>>>>            Get psSearchSQLOrigFilter to sOrigFilter
29884>>>>>>>>>            Get pbSearchSQLOrigActive to bOrigActive
29885>>>>>>>>>
29885>>>>>>>>>            Set psSQLFilter of hoDD to sOrigFilter
29886>>>>>>>>>            Set pbUseDDSqlFilters of hoDD to bOrigActive
29887>>>>>>>>>        End
29887>>>>>>>>>>
29887>>>>>>>>>
29887>>>>>>>>>        Set psSearchSQLOrigFilter to ""
29888>>>>>>>>>        Set pbSearchSQLOrigActive to False
29889>>>>>>>>>        Set phoSearchSQLFilterDD to 0
29890>>>>>>>>>        Set pbSearchSQLFilterSet to False
29891>>>>>>>>>
