29893>>>>>>>>>    Procedure ApplyFilter Handle hoDD Variant ByRef vFilterState
29895>>>>>>>>>        tWebListFilterState FilterState
29895>>>>>>>>>        tWebListFilterState FilterState
29895>>>>>>>>>        Integer iColumn iFile iField
