29895>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bSearchHiddenColumns bHidden bOrigActive bFilterSet bSupportsSQL
29895>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoFilterDD
29895>>>>>>>>>        Handle[] ahoColumns
29896>>>>>>>>>
29896>>>>>>>>>        Move False to FilterState.bDisregardFilter
29897>>>>>>>>>        Move FilterState to vFilterState
29898>>>>>>>>>
29898>>>>>>>>>        WebGet psSearchTerm to sSearchValue
29899>>>>>>>>>        If (sSearchValue = "") Begin
29901>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
29902>>>>>>>>>        End
29902>>>>>>>>>>
29902>>>>>>>>>
29902>>>>>>>>>        If (hoDD = 0) Begin
29904>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
29905>>>>>>>>>        End
29905>>>>>>>>>>
29905>>>>>>>>>
29905>>>>>>>>>        Get SupportsSQLFilters of hoDD to bSupportsSQL
29906>>>>>>>>>        If (not(bSupportsSQL)) Begin
