29945>>>>>>>>>                            Move (sSearchFilter + " OR ") to sSearchFilter
29946>>>>>>>>>                        End
29946>>>>>>>>>>
29946>>>>>>>>>                        Move (sSearchFilter + sColumnFilter) to sSearchFilter
29947>>>>>>>>>                    End
29947>>>>>>>>>>
29947>>>>>>>>>                End
29947>>>>>>>>>>
29947>>>>>>>>>            End
29947>>>>>>>>>>
29947>>>>>>>>>
29947>>>>>>>>>            Increment iColumn
29948>>>>>>>>>        Loop
29949>>>>>>>>>>
29949>>>>>>>>>
29949>>>>>>>>>        If (sSearchFilter <> "") Begin
29951>>>>>>>>>            Move ("(" + sSearchFilter + ")") to sSearchFilter
29952>>>>>>>>>        End
29952>>>>>>>>>>
29952>>>>>>>>>        Else Begin
29953>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
29954>>>>>>>>>        End
29954>>>>>>>>>>
29954>>>>>>>>>
29954>>>>>>>>>        Move sSearchFilter to sFilter
29955>>>>>>>>>        If (sOrigFilter <> "") Begin
29957>>>>>>>>>            Get SQLStrAppend of hoDD sOrigFilter sSearchFilter to sFilter
29958>>>>>>>>>        End
29958>>>>>>>>>>
29958>>>>>>>>>
29958>>>>>>>>>        If (sFilter = sOrigFilter) Begin
29960>>>>>>>>>            Procedure_Return
29961>>>>>>>>>        End
29961>>>>>>>>>>
29961>>>>>>>>>
29961>>>>>>>>>        Set psSearchSQLOrigFilter to sOrigFilter
