29967>>>>>>>>>        Move True to FilterState.bDisregardFilter
29968>>>>>>>>>        Move FilterState to vFilterState
29969>>>>>>>>>
29969>>>>>>>>>        Send Rebuild_Constraints of hoDD
29970>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
