30255>>>>>>>    //  already updated when it is called.
30255>>>>>>>    Procedure ChangeSorting Integer iCol Boolean bReverse Integer iPrevCol Boolean bPrevReverse
30257>>>>>>>        Send GridRefresh
30258>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
