31249>>>>>>>    // called when a record in the cache cannot be refound. Most likely this was deleted
31249>>>>>>>    // by another user.
31249>>>>>>>    // optionally report the error and do a refresh based around the current DD
31249>>>>>>>    Procedure HandleCacheError
31251>>>>>>>        Boolean bSuppressCacheError
31251>>>>>>>        
31251>>>>>>>        Get pbSuppressCacheError to bSuppressCacheError
31252>>>>>>>        If not bSuppressCacheError Begin 
31254>>>>>>>            Send ReportCacheError
31255>>>>>>>        End
