31582>>>>>    // returns true if this view should not allow finds on main-dd DEOs
31582>>>>>    // You want no finds with drilldowns that don't come from a main (select to zoom for same DDO)
31582>>>>>    Function IsViewNoFindOnMain Returns Boolean
31584>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NData
31584>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NData
31584>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
31584>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
31585>>>>>        If (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
31587>>>>>            // typically if you navigated from main (from select) you
31587>>>>>            // will not want to allow finds or prompts on main field indexes
31587>>>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NData
31588>>>>>            Function_Return (NData.eNavigateType = nfFromMain)
31589>>>>>        End
31589>>>>>>
31589>>>>>        Else Begin
31590>>>>>            Function_Return False
31591>>>>>        End
31591>>>>>>
31591>>>>>    End_Function
31592>>>>>    
31592>>>>>    // this this view have a No finding on a constrained parent? 
