31592>>>>>    Function IsViewNoFindOnConstrainedParent Returns Boolean
31594>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
31594>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
31595>>>>>        If (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
31597>>>>>            // typically with drill down views you don't allow finds on the
31597>>>>>            // constraining child, because that's what you drilled in from
31597>>>>>            Function_Return True
31598>>>>>        End
31598>>>>>>
31598>>>>>        Else Begin
31599>>>>>            Function_Return False
31600>>>>>        End
31600>>>>>>
31600>>>>>    End_Function
