31601>>>>>    Function IsViewReadOnly Returns Boolean
31603>>>>>        Integer eWebViewStyle
31603>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eWebViewStyle
31604>>>>>        If (eWebViewStyle = wvsDrillDown) Begin
31606>>>>>            // if this was called as read only, it's read only
31606>>>>>            tWebNavigateData NData
31606>>>>>            tWebNavigateData NData
31606>>>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NData
31607>>>>>            Function_Return (NData.bReadOnly)
31608>>>>>        End
31608>>>>>>
31608>>>>>        Else Begin
31609>>>>>            Function_Return False
31610>>>>>        End
31610>>>>>>
31610>>>>>    End_Function
