31622>>>>>        Boolean bSuccess
31622>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
31623>>>>>        If hoDD Begin
31625>>>>>            Get Main_File of hoDD to iFile
31626>>>>>            Get CurrentRowId of hoDD to RID
31627>>>>>            Get FindByRowIdEx of hoDD iFile RID to bSuccess
31628>>>>>            If not bSuccess Begin
31630>>>>>                Send OnRefreshRecordError hoDD
31631>>>>>            End
31631>>>>>>
31631>>>>>        End
31631>>>>>>
31631>>>>>    End_Procedure
