31669>>>>>    // helper for ClearConstrainFiles
31669>>>>>    Procedure ClearConstrainFile2 Handle hoDD
31671>>>>>        Handle hoDDNext
31671>>>>>        Integer iCount iMax
31671>>>>>        Set Visited_State of hoDD to True
31672>>>>>        // First process all server DDs
31672>>>>>        Get Data_Set_Server_Count of hoDD to iMax
31673>>>>>        For iCount from 0 to (iMax-1)
31679>>>>>>
31679>>>>>            Get Data_Set_Server of hoDD iCount to hoDDNext
31680>>>>>            If not (Visited_state(hoDDNext)) Begin
31682>>>>>                Send ClearConstrainFile2 hoDDNext
31683>>>>>            End
31683>>>>>>
31683>>>>>        Loop
31684>>>>>>
31684>>>>>        Set Constrain_File of hoDD to 0
31685>>>>>    End_Procedure
