31688>>>>>        If hoMainDD Begin
31690>>>>>            Send Initialize_Visited to hoMainDD False False // False=don't clear Column marks
31691>>>>>            Send ClearConstrainFile2 hoMainDD
31692>>>>>        End
31692>>>>>>
31692>>>>>    End_Procedure
