32578>>>>>    
32578>>>>>    // Triggered when a state hash is defined allowing the application to add a custom piece to the
32578>>>>>    // hash. This piece can be used inside OnShow / OnLoad / OnNavigateForward to restore the state.
32578>>>>>    //
32578>>>>>    // Params:
32578>>>>>    //      ByRef sStateHash    String that should be filled with the custom hash.
