32581>>>>>    
32581>>>>>    // Determines the custom state hash by parsing it out of the view state hash. The view state
32581>>>>>    // has is retrieved form the navigation data or read directly from the url.
32581>>>>>    //
32581>>>>>    // Returns:
32581>>>>>    //      Custom state hash.
32581>>>>>    Function CustomStateHash Returns String
32583>>>>>        Integer eViewStyle
32583>>>>>        String sStateHash sView sRecordId sCustomHash
32583>>>>>        tWebNavigateData navData
32583>>>>>        tWebNavigateData navData
32583>>>>>        
32583>>>>>        Get peWebViewStyle to eViewStyle
32584>>>>>        
32584>>>>>        If (eViewStyle = wvsDesktop) Begin
32586>>>>>            Get StateHash of (Host(Self)) to sStateHash
32587>>>>>        End
32587>>>>>>
32587>>>>>        Else If (eViewStyle = wvsDrillDown or eViewStyle = wvsDialog) Begin
32590>>>>>            Get GetNavigateData to navData
32591>>>>>            Get NamedValueGet navData.NamedValues "Init_StateHash" to sStateHash
32592>>>>>        End
32592>>>>>>
32592>>>>>        
32592>>>>>        Send ParseViewStateHash of (Host(Self)) sStateHash (&sView) (&sRecordId) (&sCustomHash)
32593>>>>>        
32593>>>>>        Function_Return sCustomHash
32594>>>>>    End_Function
