32973>>>>>>>>>    // UTF16 functions that allow you to move between a char (UTF8, ANS, OEM) and a UTF16 buffer
32973>>>>>>>>>    
32973>>>>>>>>>    // converts from buffer of encoded eCharType to a new UTF16 buffer
32973>>>>>>>>>    // note: Utf16FromBuffer with eCharType of CP_OEM can replace OEMToUTF16Buffer
32973>>>>>>>>>    Function Utf16FromBuffer  Pointer pMultiCharBuffer Integer eCharType Integer ByRef iLen Returns Pointer
32975>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pWideBuf
32975>>>>>>>>>        Integer iWideBufLen iStrLen
32975>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to pWideBuf
32976>>>>>>>>>        Move 0 to iLen
32977>>>>>>>>>        If (pMultiCharBuffer) Begin
32979>>>>>>>>>            Move (CStringSize(pMultiCharBuffer)) to iStrLen
32980>>>>>>>>>            If (iStrLen) Begin
32982>>>>>>>>>                Move (MultiToWideBuffer(eCharType,pMultiCharBuffer, iStrLen, AddressOf(pWideBuf))) to iLen
32983>>>>>>>>>                If (iLen=0) Begin
32985>>>>>>>>>                    Function_Return 0
32986>>>>>>>>>                End
32986>>>>>>>>>>
32986>>>>>>>>>            End
32986>>>>>>>>>>
32986>>>>>>>>>        End
32986>>>>>>>>>>
32986>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return pWideBuf
32987>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
32988>>>>>>>>>    
32988>>>>>>>>>    Function Utf16FromStr String sValue Integer eCharType Integer ByRef iLen Returns Pointer
32990>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pValue
32990>>>>>>>>>        Get Utf16FromBuffer (AddressOf(sValue)) eCharType (&iLen) to pValue
32991>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return pValue
32992>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
