33588>>>>>    // Handles API calls made by the JavaScript Engine. It parses the incoming JSON and performs several validations. 
33588>>>>>    //
33588>>>>>    // HTTP errors will be returned on:
33588>>>>>    //  - Bad request format (couldn't parse JSON)
33588>>>>>    //  - Invalid JSON format
33588>>>>>    //  - Version check fails
33588>>>>>    //  - Other DataFlex errors occurred
