33796>>>>>>>>>            For iPart from 1 to (SizeOfArray(aParts) - 1)
33802>>>>>>>>>>
33802>>>>>>>>>                Move (StrSplitToArray(aParts[iPart], "=")) to aPair
33803>>>>>>>>>                If (SizeOfArray(aPair) > 1) Begin
33805>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(Uppercase(aPair[0]))) to aValues[iVal].sName
33806>>>>>>>>>                    Move (Trim(aPair[1])) to aValues[iVal].sValue
33807>>>>>>>>>                End
33807>>>>>>>>>>
33807>>>>>>>>>            Loop
33808>>>>>>>>>>
33808>>>>>>>>>        End
33808>>>>>>>>>>
33808>>>>>>>>>        
33808>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return aValues
