33937>>>>>>>>>    //      sFieldName      Name of the field.
33937>>>>>>>>>    //      ucData          Chunk of raw file data.
33937>>>>>>>>>    Procedure OnFileChunk String sFieldName UChar[] ByRef ucData
33939>>>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
33940>>>>>>>>>    
33940>>>>>>>>>    //  Called after all the chunks of a file have been passed.
33940>>>>>>>>>    //  
33940>>>>>>>>>    //  Params:
