33944>>>>>>>
33944>>>>>>>// This class is capable of parsing multipart/form-data requests. These requests are used to post
33944>>>>>>>// binary data and usually files. The WAF file upload uses this class. Because it works in chunks
33944>>>>>>>// are used this class is capable of handling large files. The main implementation is in the
33944>>>>>>>// cWebHttpMultipartFormdataHandler_mixin so it can also be used by other classes like
33944>>>>>>>// cLocalWebResourceManagerProxy.
33944>>>>>>>Class cWebHttpMultipartFormdataHandler is a cWebHttpHandler
33945>>>>>>>    
33945>>>>>>>    Procedure Construct_Object
33947>>>>>>>        Forward Send Construct_Object
33949>>>>>>>        
33949>>>>>>>        Send Define_cWebHttpMultipartFormdataHandler_mixin
33950>>>>>>>    End_Procedure
