34660>>>>>>>>>    //  Generates random data.
34660>>>>>>>>>    Function GenerateRandom Integer iBytes Returns UChar[]
34662>>>>>>>>>        Handle hProv
34662>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] uaResult
34663>>>>>>>>>        Boolean bRes
34663>>>>>>>>>        
34663>>>>>>>>>        Get AcquireContext to hProv
34664>>>>>>>>>        
34664>>>>>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(uaResult, iBytes)) to uaResult
34665>>>>>>>>>        Move (CryptGenRandom(hProv, iBytes, AddressOf(uaResult))) to bRes
34666>>>>>>>>>        
34666>>>>>>>>>        Get ReleaseContext hProv to bRes
34667>>>>>>>>>        
34667>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return uaResult
34668>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
