34669>>>>>>>>>    //  Generates random data and does a base64 encoding to properly present it as a string.
34669>>>>>>>>>    Function GenerateRandomString Integer iLength Returns String
34671>>>>>>>>>        String sResult
34671>>>>>>>>>        UChar[] ucData
34672>>>>>>>>>        Pointer pBase64
34672>>>>>>>>>        Integer iVoid
34672>>>>>>>>>        
34672>>>>>>>>>        Get GenerateRandom iLength to ucData
34673>>>>>>>>>        
34673>>>>>>>>>        Move (Base64Encode(AddressOf(ucData), iLength)) to pBase64
34674>>>>>>>>>        Move (PointerToString(pBase64)) to sResult
34675>>>>>>>>>        Move (Free(pBase64)) to iVoid
34676>>>>>>>>>        
34676>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return (Left(sResult, iLength))
34677>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
