34710>>>>>>>    // User hook to manage what to do when creating a new client/server session. By default
34710>>>>>>>    // the system will create a globally unique identifier GUID as a new session key.
34710>>>>>>>    // This is called automatically during LoadWebApp and the session key is passed back to the 
34710>>>>>>>    // client.
34710>>>>>>>    // sRemoteAddress - Is the IP address of the client.
34710>>>>>>>    // Returns        - The new session key.
34710>>>>>>>    Function CreateSession String sRemoteAddress Returns String
34712>>>>>>>        String sSessionKey
34712>>>>>>>        Handle hoCryptRandom
34712>>>>>>>        Integer iLength
34712>>>>>>>        
34712>>>>>>>        Get piSessionKeyLength to iLength
34713>>>>>>>        
34713>>>>>>>        //  Generate a random key (slightly too long)
34713>>>>>>>        Get phoRandomizer to hoCryptRandom
34714>>>>>>>        Get GenerateRandomString of hoCryptRandom (iLength + 10) to sSessionKey
34715>>>>>>>        
34715>>>>>>>        //  Clear out special characters as these might cause issues with older browsers and ASP Classic, and then cut to the proper length
34715>>>>>>>        Move (Left(Replaces("+", Replaces("/", sSessionKey, ""), ""), iLength)) to sSessionKey
34716>>>>>>>        
34716>>>>>>>        Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
34717>>>>>>>        
34717>>>>>>>        Function_Return sSessionKey
34718>>>>>>>    End_Function
