34755>>>>>>>    // Returns     - True if the session key is valid and the AJAX call can continue.
34755>>>>>>>    Function ValidateSession String sSessionKey Returns Boolean
34757>>>>>>>        If (Length(sSessionKey) = piSessionKeyLength(Self)) Begin
34759>>>>>>>            Set psSessionKey to sSessionKey
34760>>>>>>>            Function_Return True
34761>>>>>>>        End
34761>>>>>>>>
34761>>>>>>>        
34761>>>>>>>        Function_Return False
34762>>>>>>>    End_Function
