34776>>>>>    Function IsLoadWebAppCall tWebCallContext ByRef cctx Returns Boolean
34778>>>>>        Integer i 
34778>>>>>        
34778>>>>>        For i from 0 to (SizeOfArray(cctx.request.aActions) - 1)
34784>>>>>>
34784>>>>>            If (cctx.request.aActions[i].sTarget = "" and cctx.request.aActions[i].sAction = "LoadWebApp") Begin
34786>>>>>                Function_Return True
34787>>>>>            End
34787>>>>>>
34787>>>>>        Loop
34788>>>>>>
34788>>>>>        
34788>>>>>        Function_Return False
