35295>>>>>// Handler for server-side web properties (WebProperty=Server and WebProperty=ServerSession). The
35295>>>>>// base class contains the logic for storing these in memory. At first access they are loaded from 
35295>>>>>// a store (cWebServerPropStore, usually the database) and at the end of a request they are written
35295>>>>>// to the store. This class handles the logic for determining the key and serializing to / from a 
35295>>>>>// JSON string passed along as UChar array.
