35407>>>>>    
35407>>>>>    //
35407>>>>>    // Augments the InitializeSyncProps with logic to initialize the advanced properties. For
35407>>>>>    // server web properties these are not serialized to a value tree so this is different as for
35407>>>>>    // client web properties.
