35413>>>>>        
35413>>>>>        For iProp from 0 to (iSize - 1)
35419>>>>>>
35419>>>>>            Get FindWebObject of hoLocator aAdvProps[iProp].sO to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].hoObj
35420>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bChanged
35421>>>>>            Move True                   to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bDeserialized
35422>>>>>            Move aAdvProps[iProp]       to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSvrProp
35423>>>>>        Loop
35424>>>>>>
35424>>>>>        
