35455>>>>>                Get GenerateRandomString of hoCryptRandom (piGenKeyLength(Self)) to sKey
35456>>>>>                
35456>>>>>                WebSet psSPKey of (phowebhost(Self)) to sKey
35457>>>>>            End 
35457>>>>>>
35457>>>>>        End
35457>>>>>>
35457>>>>>        
35457>>>>>        Function_Return sKey
35458>>>>>    End_Function
