35523>>>>>    //
35523>>>>>    // Special logic for when a view is loaded. When loading a view the client can already have web
35523>>>>>    // properties being webset and they are passed to the server. This function makes sure they are
35523>>>>>    // passed back to client as if they where just set by marking all of the properties of the 
35523>>>>>    // passed view as changed.
35523>>>>>    //
35523>>>>>    Procedure ProcessLoadViewClientSyncProps Handle hoView
35525>>>>>        // Analyses all of the sync properties passed in the request and stored in gaSyncProps. If any of these properties belong to
35525>>>>>        // the passed hoView object or a child of hoView, then they are transferred to gaSyncChangedProps. This has the effect of
35525>>>>>        // marking the property as changed during the AJAX Call so the values will be sent back to the client.
35525>>>>>        //
35525>>>>>        // This is used by LoadView to ensure that any cached sync property values of the loaded view that were passed to the server
35525>>>>>        // will be passed back to the client so that the client will consider them to have been WebSet during the call and will apply
35525>>>>>        // the property changes. This forms part of our support for caching WebSet property changes of views that have never been
35525>>>>>        // loaded on the client.
35525>>>>>        Integer iObject icObject iTo iStoreIndex
35525>>>>>        Integer iProperty   icProperty
35525>>>>>        Handle hoObject hoWebNeighborhood
35525>>>>>        
35525>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
35526>>>>>        
35526>>>>>        // Iterate the web properties. We are looking for objects that match hoView or are
35526>>>>>        // child objects of hoView....
35526>>>>>        Get piSize to icObject
35527>>>>>        
35527>>>>>        For iObject from 0 to (icObject - 1)
35533>>>>>>
35533>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborhood of gaSyncObjectHandles[iStoreIndex][iObject] to hoWebNeighborhood
35534>>>>>            
35534>>>>>            If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoView) Begin
35536>>>>>                // Mark all web properties of this object as changed....
35536>>>>>                Move True to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].bContainsChanges     // Mark the object as changed
35537>>>>>                
35537>>>>>                // Iterate the properties of this object....
35537>>>>>                Move (SizeOfArray(gaSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].aP)) to icProperty
35538>>>>>                
35538>>>>>                For iProperty from 0 to (icProperty - 1)
35544>>>>>>
35544>>>>>                    Move iProperty to gaSyncChangedProps[iStoreIndex][iObject].aiIndex[iProperty]
35545>>>>>                Loop
35546>>>>>>
35546>>>>>            End
35546>>>>>>
35546>>>>>        Loop
35547>>>>>>
35547>>>>>        
35547>>>>>        
35547>>>>>        //  Iterate all advanced web properties to mark them as changed as well
35547>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]) - 1) to iTo
35548>>>>>        For iProperty from 0 to iTo
35554>>>>>>
35554>>>>>            Get phoWebNeighborhood of gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProperty].hoObj to hoWebNeighborhood
35555>>>>>            If (hoWebNeighborhood = hoView) Begin
35557>>>>>                Move True to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProperty].bChanged
35558>>>>>            End
35558>>>>>>
35558>>>>>            
35558>>>>>        Loop
35559>>>>>>
35559>>>>>    End_Procedure
