35560>>>>>    //
35560>>>>>    // Augments the initialization with the logic for advanced sync props. These are serialized to 
35560>>>>>    // a value tree when sent to the client (which doesn't happen for server props) and they are 
35560>>>>>    // not deserialized until a webget is performed.
35560>>>>>    //
35560>>>>>    Procedure InitializeSyncProps tWebSyncProps[] aSyncProps tWebAdvSyncProp[] aAdvSyncProps
35562>>>>>        Integer iSize iProp iStoreIndex
35562>>>>>        Handle hoLocator
35562>>>>>        
35562>>>>>        Get piStoreIndex to iStoreIndex
35563>>>>>        Get phoWebControlLocator to hoLocator
35564>>>>>        
35564>>>>>        //  Initialize the advanced property cache
35564>>>>>        Move (SizeOfArray(aAdvSyncProps)) to iSize
35565>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex], 0)) to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]   //  Clear it just to be sure
35566>>>>>        Move (ResizeArray(gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex], iSize)) to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex]
35567>>>>>        
35567>>>>>        For iProp from 0 to (iSize - 1)
35573>>>>>>
35573>>>>>            Get FindWebObject of hoLocator aAdvSyncProps[iProp].sO to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].hoObj
35574>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bChanged
35575>>>>>            Move False                  to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].bDeserialized
35576>>>>>            Move 0                      to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSvrProp.vV
35577>>>>>            Move aAdvSyncProps[iProp]   to gaAdvSyncProps[iStoreIndex][iProp].tSyncProp
35578>>>>>        Loop
35579>>>>>>
35579>>>>>        
35579>>>>>        Forward Send InitializeSyncProps aSyncProps
35581>>>>>    End_Procedure
