35975>>>// WebApp wrapper object. Each AJAX WebApp must have one and only one cWebApp object. 
35975>>>// The webapp object is used as a container for...
35975>>>// - The application's commandbar/titlebar (menubar, toolbars, breadcrumb etc)
35975>>>// - Each cWebView and cWebModalDialog
35975>>>//
35975>>>// Adds interface for:
35975>>>// - Loading the WebApp
35975>>>// - General handling web service requests,
35975>>>// - Registering web service objects (cWebView etc),
35975>>>// - Locating cWebControl objects (i.e. retreiving the object handle of any cWebControl),
35975>>>// - Managing client-server web properties,
35975>>>// - Show/Hide View interface.
35975>>>// - Height & width properties.
35975>>>// - cWebUIObject support (via mixin)
35975>>>// 
35975>>>
35975>>>
35975>>>
